  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEEDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Formal legal actions that are relevant to claims arising under the Loan Document and involving the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-CLOSING CHANGE OF CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions for changes in ownership before the closing of a financial transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to employee benefit plans for which unfunded liabilities are assessed under the PBGC actuarial assumptions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to various pension and benefit plans associated with the Borrower, which have implications for its financial liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Strategic outlines detailing actions to achieve regulatory compliance or other objectives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3679e0426d9ba539d7a46289e2bab63a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b75c230455e9616a385ea8bda68b04d</data>
