  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBT SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The ongoing requirement of the Borrower to pay interest and principal amounts on the loans provided by Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUB-AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agent acting under the direction of the Administrative Agent to fulfill obligations related to the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sub-agents appointed by the Administrative Agent to perform duties related to the administration of the Loan Documents and manage specific functions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af268fffead491c2994a023017c7b638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCELERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause that enables lenders to demand immediate repayment upon certain events."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HAZARDOUS MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hazardous Materials are substances whose presence or release may trigger Environmental Liability associated with the Borrower and its properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hazardous Materials refer to various substances that are classified under environmental regulations, impacting the Borrower's obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Substances that pose a risk to health or the environment when improperly managed or released."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcfdf8a71bd320a62004e0e384e11c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b4182c08d76c1d482af7a301493f62</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPLACEMENT LENDING INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New lending locations can be designated by Lenders for loan processing and payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNREIMBURSED EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs not reimbursed by the Borrower but deemed necessary by the Administrative Agent or related parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROTECTED PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Protected Party in this context refers to individuals or entities that are shielded from liability, specifically concerning damages arising from the use of information distributed in connection with the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party protected under the Agreement from claims resulting from negligence or misconduct."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23731f788c5c083ebf38a42584c7dea</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal release agreements that allow parties to waive specific rights or obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The reference to waivers in Section 16.04 indicates the legal allowances for non-enforcement of certain obligations under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section on Waivers indicates that the Guarantor relinquishes certain legal protections normally available under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-904c0cc387dffe2b87a7d3f92f2a414f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A body of regulations that governs the interaction between human activities and the natural environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Law sets the regulations regarding hazardous materials that are referenced in relation to the Borrower's obligations and rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b4182c08d76c1d482af7a301493f62</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3:00 P.M. (NEW YORK TIME)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific time mentioned when the funds from Lenders are made available to the Borrower, particularly for Dollar-denominated loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amendments allow for modifications to the Loan Documents as mutually agreed upon by the Required Lenders and the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amendments refer to modifications made to the Borrower’s certificate of incorporation that must be delivered to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Changes or modifications made to existing agreements to reflect new terms or conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c120a778327f296345bae50f8d1508f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All financial obligations that the Borrower must fulfill as stipulated in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations or debts that parties may incur as a result of tax assessments or failures to comply with regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations that the Borrower and its Subsidiaries owe to external parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal responsibilities that may arise from violations of rules or regulations, particularly in environmental contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities refer to the financial obligations of the Borrower that must be disclosed and managed under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4624e829973bed7d3dbe1f2bc639fd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Overnight Rate is the interest applicable for payments made by the Lender to the Administrative Agent for timely financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Overnight Rate is the interest charged on the distributed amounts that are due for repayment to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13f1cbe5d37f2115e7fdee4a6fef2330&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a73a441bb280da7c7eac26f41db97d87</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consequential Damages refer to the damages that parties agree to waive under the terms of the Agreement, specifically indirect or punitive damages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a23731f788c5c083ebf38a42584c7dea</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal assurances protecting against potential losses or damages, often part of agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SAME DAY FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Same Day Funds are the specific type of funds required for immediate payment by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent for any amounts owed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Same Day Funds refers to the immediate payment requirement that the Lenders must fulfill upon demand from the Administrative Agent after a distribution issue occurs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13f1cbe5d37f2115e7fdee4a6fef2330&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a73a441bb280da7c7eac26f41db97d87</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.07 ACCOUNTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions regarding the interpretation of accounting terms based on the Agreement Accounting Principles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEVERAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Multiple obligations that different lenders or borrowers must fulfill under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respective obligations of the Lenders and Issuing Lenders hereunder are distinct and not collective."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e50dc3791859bd42e6b79be8ac39d58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific loan arrangement where the Borrower may borrow in certain currencies based on interest periods agreed with Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific type of Advance that is made in a Foreign Currency, detailing terms related to its scope and application."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement based on Eurocurrency rates, with specific interest calculations tied to the interest period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of advance that allows the borrower to withdraw funds in currencies that are typically traded in international markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of financial advance based on Eurocurrency rates, subject to a specified Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that is denominated in a foreign currency and subject to specific interest periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Eurocurrency Advance is a type of loan that may be converted from an Alternate Base Rate Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Eurocurrency Advance shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Advance for the relevant Interest Period..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Advance means an Advance or Loan which, except as otherwise provided in Section 2.11, bears interest based on the applicable Eurocurrency Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fb6e2d4916072445b0d7943e6df0abe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d35133a09e796f51c620fe44c317a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436dbc8e8c3aea78e296e758404cb6e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.15&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.15 outlines the terms under which the Administrative Agent assumes the availability of funds from Lenders for Advances, establishing clear operational guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13f1cbe5d37f2115e7fdee4a6fef2330</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.08 SEVERABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions regarding the severability of any inoperative or invalid clauses within the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision that requires parties to keep shared information secure and not disclose it to others."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RATE DETERMINATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Means, with respect to any Interest Period, the date that is two (2) Business Days prior to the first day of such Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate Determination Date refers to the specific date on which the relevant interest rate is determined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The obligation refers to the responsibilities that the Lender has regarding loan terms and participant agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation refers to the specific responsibility of the Borrower to make timely loan payments to the Lenders and the Issuing Lender under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation pertains to the duties outlined in the Loan Documents that the Borrower must comply with."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca785d11c173b114c75a86d24a9c1982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a73a441bb280da7c7eac26f41db97d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.09 NONLIABILITY OF LENDERS&quot;">
