  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"...Amend this Section 8.02 without the consent of all Lenders..."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision outlining the process and requirements for amendments to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A section outlining constraints on the Defaulting Lender's rights regarding amendments, waivers, or consents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 8.02 addresses amendments to the loan agreement and the procedures required for such modifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 8.02 elaborates on provisions that govern the compliance requirements related to the obligations of the Borrower and Lender under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 8.02 outlines specific procedural guidelines concerning amendments, waivers, or consents under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specifies the requisite number of Lenders required for necessary consents and amendments as manifested in Section 8.02."</data>
