<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any amounts paid under this Section shall be without duplication of eurocurrency adjustments in the definition of 'Eurocurrency Rate'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Eurocurrency Rate serves as a reference for reserve requirements against the financial assets requiring changes due to laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate applicable for Eurocurrency Loans determined by the interbank market."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate on Eurocurrency deposits, which affects the cost of loans in the Eurocurrency market."&lt;SEP&gt;"The reference interest rate applicable for Eurocurrency Advances for the specified periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Eurocurrency Rate” means, with respect to a Eurocurrency Advance..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e</data>
