<node id="&quot;TAX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A compulsory financial charge imposed by the government that may affect Lenders and Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any amount imposed or asserted on parties within the transaction, relevant for calculations of liabilities and indemnifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Official levies imposed on payments made by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent or Lender, which are subjected to specific exemptions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax obligations are mentioned in the context of indemnification payments and additional amounts related to the Borrower and Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-85ef5ea8464dfb22dae8e3df282ea04f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf894b623f9cbade8155fbff04b0edc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c</data>
