<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regulatory provision that outlines the reliance the Administrative Agent can place on documents and instruments during loan management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Details the reliance by the administrative agent regarding its duties and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific subsection detailing the non-reliance of parties on the Administrative Agent and other lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ca92fb46e43aac35741ad94be06baf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77ecd873e7a9d5e2ffb5d6892446a1df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7633d7a599488b163a331c3d926d3365</data>
