  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDING INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any location specified by the Administrative Agent for receiving payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lending Installation indicates where loans are initiated or processed, critical for the operation of the Lender's business."&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable Lending Installation of the Lender is involved in making, maintaining, or funding Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The location or jurisdiction in which the Lender operates, relevant for determining applicable taxes and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The location selected by a Lender to book its loans and through which loan payments are processed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The office, branch, subsidiary, or affiliate of a Lender or Agent involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific operational location or branch of a lender from which a loan is issued or managed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf894b623f9cbade8155fbff04b0edc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45eacffe710b8a1539c2b0e28ec9c0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef5ea8464dfb22dae8e3df282ea04f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
