<node id="&quot;EXISTING LETTER OF CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LETTER OF CREDIT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A letter of credit issued prior to the closing date, which must be included in the documentation provided to the administrative agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"An outstanding Letter of Credit that exists prior to the application process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Letters of Credit that existed prior to the Closing Date, which are deemed issued under the current Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Previously issued letters of credit that continue to be valid under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to letters of credit issued pursuant to Section 2.03 that exist at the time of this agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45eacffe710b8a1539c2b0e28ec9c0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a</data>
