  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A modification or addition to the Agreement, requiring approval from the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amendments to the Loan Documents must be in writing, signed by the Administrative Agent with the consent of Lenders as stipulated in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Amendment is a formal change or addition made to the original terms of the loan Agreement, affecting the rights and obligations of the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"consent to an amendment or waiver approved by the Required Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7dde35fec0c8bee31e9959cd10aeb752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c42000811c18c4fe1fb14e6839c213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef03c2a3bc83b467c592d30c98456018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b81ad32680319d4fa9bb79e2517486d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.11 addresses the reliance on margin stock in the context of extending or maintaining credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a78ac18a08e4ac60633a82d5e95b9af</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
