  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.19&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A stipulation within the Agreement delineating certain conditions applicable to Participants as if they were Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.19 outlines specifics regarding the Lenders’ actions on defined matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"the provisions of this Section 2.19 shall not be construed to apply to..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7dde35fec0c8bee31e9959cd10aeb752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b81ad32680319d4fa9bb79e2517486d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf07809d1746fad0fc15e800a6e13c9</data>
