</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.12&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 9.12 addresses the disclosure obligations of the Borrower, Issuing Lenders, and Lenders concerning relationships and investments with Affiliates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9a78ac18a08e4ac60633a82d5e95b9af</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section detailing the terms under which the guarantors agree to ensure the obligations of the borrower are met, outlining the associated responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantee refers to the legal assurance that each Guarantor will fulfill obligations in relation to the financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantee refers to the obligations of the Guarantor to cover the Borrower's debts as detailed in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-88b24f224a12be42ba1f1dbc4b72037c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7633d7a599488b163a331c3d926d3365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0d8174003f4772facdd639b135093a</data>
