<node id="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A structured credit arrangement allowing the Borrower to draw, repay, and redraw loans as necessary."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured loan arrangement that allows the Borrower to withdraw, repay, and borrow again up to a specified limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan arrangement specified in the agreement, under which the Borrower can withdraw funds as needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Revolving Credit Facility is a type of credit arrangement that allows Borrowers to withdraw, repay, and borrow again, subject to the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Revolving Credit Facility is part of the agreement involving various loan documents and their respective obligations among the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The revolving credit facility established pursuant to Article 2, including any increase established pursuant to Section 2.22."&lt;SEP&gt;"The revolving credit facility is the structure through which GXO Logistics, Inc. is provided financing under the terms established in the Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc38152b0f228851eb2001881889cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c87b9e7043c61cd132d4af9cb79a608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2b28c1dc4239fb1b4dc694b26a9338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcfdf8a71bd320a62004e0e384e11c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee01decfe8a02e5dc4bd8b1aa7fd3855</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRONTING EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fronting Exposure refers to the risk associated with the obligations of the Issuing Lenders when a Borrower defaults on their commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount at risk for the issuing lenders regarding letters of credit which needs to be collateralized by cash."&lt;SEP&gt;"The exposure faced by Issuing Lenders due to their responsibility for issuing Letters of Credit when a Defaulting Lender is present."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial risk exposure retained by Issuing Lenders related to the Defaulting Lender and cash collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The risk amount for lenders regarding letters of credit that needs to be collateralized."&lt;SEP&gt;"The risk exposure borne by lenders related to the issuance of letters of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The risk faced by the Issuing Lender concerning guarantees made under the issued Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"the potential risk associated with a lender providing credit or guarantees for foreign currencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03b2d3addc3724118fcaa9cbe2d864f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef03c2a3bc83b467c592d30c98456018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07d22735da3f44da96c1e4f1bea670b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe12461084bb91bf3fa92e79fc2890e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
