  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A commitment concerning additional financing that lenders can choose to provide at their discretion."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Incremental Revolving Credit Increase is an additional borrowing capacity provided to the borrower under the existing loan agreement, subject to certain terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of increasing the amount available under the revolving credit facility, subject to conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-349e138a26328314f6d91c26c4b4d6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3e7677f7f7b78ac8baeaf00df9e5e3e</data>
