<node id="&quot;SECTION 12.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provision in the Agreement that outlines the terms for assignment and delegation of rights by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 12.01 details the conditions under which loan rights may be assigned, part of the covenants stipulated in the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section containing terms related to loan assignments and extensions in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section of the agreement that sets forth the requirements for an Eligible Assignee and related consent provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"a specific clause in the agreement that outlines consent requirements for assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"assignment pursuant to Section 12.01 outlines the procedures regarding extensions of the Existing Stated Maturity Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13482f9d41736bece8f6cc18418a9fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78df53bf404a8c04f30aed8e096f054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d92f3ae85f5d9dc7cd636aa2549b31</data>
