<node id="&quot;ARTICLE 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the credit agreement detailing representations and warranties that must remain true for further actions to be valid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Article 5 contains specific representations and warranties related to the agreement, critical for maintaining the integrity of the contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Article 5 of this Agreement establishes the representations and warranties to be true as of the Extension Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"the representations and warranties contained in Article 5 are true and correct in all material respects."</data>
