<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assignment and Assumption is a process wherein the original lender assigns their rights and obligations to another party."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assignment and Assumption is the process by which Lenders transfer their rights and obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit B – Form of Assignment and Assumption that outlines the terms for transferring the rights and obligations under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document that defines the transfer of rights and obligations between Lenders in the context of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation regarding the transfer of rights or obligations related to the loan, as noted in Section 12.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"a legal document executed pursuant to Section 12.01 that allows for the transfer of loan rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"a legal document outlining the assignment and assumption of rights and obligations between a Lender and an Eligible Assignee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4775969ba9c4358815c44ba19ab6cf61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3e5cabd1adf8bfb109a8c35cc714a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128157f36e29f84a8759014f2c0bac7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6633392fc0a2358006ce0dd843d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ba5dd3dff3a1a68f89de13b8aa21f2</data>
