<node id="&quot;XPO LOGISTICS, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The entity involved in the distribution of shares to the Borrower's shareholders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The parent company that the Borrower will cease to be a wholly-owned subsidiary of, linked to the conditions prior to the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"XPO Logistics, Inc. is mentioned as the entity whose shares of common stock are being discussed in the context of a distribution to its shareholders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b4182c08d76c1d482af7a301493f62</data>
