  <data key="d2">chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRO RATA SHARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender’s Revolving Loans are made according to its respective Pro Rata Share of the Aggregate Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indicates the proportionate share of L/C Participants in payments related to the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro Rata Share defines each Lender's portion or share of the total Loan under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pro Rata Share refers to the proportional distribution of loan proceeds or obligations among lenders based on their individual commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the proportional share of payments and obligations that L/C Participants hold in relation to the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The portion of the total commitment that corresponds to each lender based on their respective commitment amounts under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportional share of commissions distributed to L/C Participants based on their respective participation in the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportional share of obligations or fees that each lender is responsible for, based on their respective contributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proportionate share of the loan amount provided to each Lender based on their commitment in the Revolving Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respective share of obligations and rights each L/C Participant holds in relation to the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The share of an obligation that each Lender must bear if the Borrower defaults on payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The share of loans and participations that must be paid and satisfied by the Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The share of obligations that a Defaulting Lender holds regarding letters of credit issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"The share of the loan amount allocated to a lender, calculated without regard to a Defaulting Lender's Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"greater than its Pro Rata Share to which it is entitled pursuant hereto."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a575e820a47b3c2dbd1089d67ed6dfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdb56df8c98cd2c1ef5d8cac7dcfbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dde35fec0c8bee31e9959cd10aeb752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf07809d1746fad0fc15e800a6e13c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e08590c6f860ab659cec13d7e2426aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509c304656080c8e86ce3cd455d89065&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3e7677f7f7b78ac8baeaf00df9e5e3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d40b4e9dc14bb67b22b82308d7b947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
