<node id="&quot;BORROWING NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document that initiates a borrowing request under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notice issued by a borrower to indicate the intent to borrow funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal request by the Borrower detailing the terms and conditions for drawing funds from the loan facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"A notice indicating the Borrower's request to draw funds from the Revolving Loan facility, subject to the agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A notice sent by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent indicating the intention to request funds from the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exhibit E – Form of Borrowing Notice that instructs Lenders to advance loan amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f248cd4e812b91a37d2ecd4ea05ab17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24419696c56548b55b76e26989b6a45a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1</data>
