  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Definition of Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money as including Indebtedness described under a specific clause of the definition of Indebtedness for Borrowed Money of any Major Subsidiary that is not a Guarantor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Particular types of debt obligations that may have different collateral requirements related to the Borrower's financial capacity and asset evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any specified debt obligations that are to be refinanced as per the document's definitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 6.10 provides details on existing specified indebtedness as it relates to the Borrower's financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money refers to specific debts that the Borrower may incur, as allowed under the terms of the Agreement."</data>
