  <data key="d1">"A Qualified Professional Asset Manager refers to an entity managing funds who fulfills specific regulatory criteria in relation to the use of plan assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity responsible for making investment decisions for the Lender in accordance with regulatory guidelines, specifically defined under Part VI of PTE 84-14."</data>
