</node>
<node id="&quot;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of payment that was mistakenly sent and does not fulfill any Obligations owed by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Erroneous Payment is any incorrectly transmitted funds that must be returned to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Erroneous Payment is defined as a payment made in error, which affects the obligations of the Lender or Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payments identified as erroneous that must be returned to the Administrative Agent within a specified timeframe."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d277b1d67ae447d64c60885603bfc58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2312b6c1d8ad4b95ad6661f4fa1b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A potential business deal or merger that could impact the financial status of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A process in which the Borrower acquires assets or properties, potentially leading to the incurrence of debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acquisition refers to the process by which the Borrower can bought or merged with another entity, impacting its indebtedness as per the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acquisition refers to the process or transaction involved in acquiring an entity or asset within the defined terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acquisition refers to transactions involving the Borrower or its Subsidiaries acquiring assets or equity of other Persons."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obtaining of properties or assets, which may involve financial commitments from the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57790ed9c8601659e5a900ae22c9e87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85242d66571c09fe35aa36fa705e26f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfc99b3c1c21fe10f6e947ba5f57d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0acdd477847e0ceb3f6060dfa6826b3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTES PAYABLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial instruments representing extensions of credit that the Person is obliged to repay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;15 DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The timeframe in which Lenders must respond to the Borrower's extension request."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-349e138a26328314f6d91c26c4b4d6de</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACQUISITION DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Acquisition Debt pertains to any Indebtedness for Borrowed Money of the Borrower or any of its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acquisition Debt refers to the debt incurred specifically for acquisitions, which is treated separately when calculating leverage ratios."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness for borrowed money issued for financing a Material Acquisition and related transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REIMBURSEMENT OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower's duty to repay any funds drawn against letters of credit or other secured financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The responsibility of the Person to reimburse amounts related to letters of credit issued on their behalf."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0acdd477847e0ceb3f6060dfa6826b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWO BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined timeframe for the Payment Recipient to return any Erroneous Payments to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFICER'S CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An officer's certificate certifies that specified conditions are satisfied on the Extension Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFERRED PURCHASE PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligations for payment for goods or services received, not immediately settled."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal trust established to manage the benefit of funds held for the Lenders and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The trust refers to the legal arrangement where Erroneous Payments are held for the benefit of the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-88b24f224a12be42ba1f1dbc4b72037c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;YIELD PROTECTION SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Yield Protection Section outlines conditions under which changes in law impact lenders' expectations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any financial obligations, loans, or debts held by the Borrower or other relevant parties under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any money owed, including all account balances, that is subject to lenders' rights under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness includes the financial obligations of the Borrower and is defined within the context of various borrowing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness refers to the Borrower's total obligations, including debts and loans, which need to be reported in financial statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness refers to the total amount of money the Borrower owes under various agreements and loans outlaid in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations that are assumed or guaranteed by a Person, particularly with respect to financial liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the total outstanding debt owed by the Borrower, encompassing financial obligations that need to be met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Represents the amount of borrowed money owed by the Borrower or its Subsidiaries, often referred to in the context of Acquisition Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total money borrowed or obligation to pay back money within the Borrower's financial structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total sum of obligations that the Borrower owes to its creditors, particularly in relation to borrowed money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57790ed9c8601659e5a900ae22c9e87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b019f5d32da5b8873398bb878e3891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b4182c08d76c1d482af7a301493f62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cd9748d004c4b865b0c54ca99b6c09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-455f5d24af85e0e01ce99360a0fe0f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0acdd477847e0ceb3f6060dfa6826b3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINGENT OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contingent obligations are liabilities that may arise depending on future events, impacting the Borrower's financial commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations that may arise based on specific conditions related to the Person's financial commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal entitlements of Lenders concerning the loan obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rights mentioned relate to the contractual obligations and privileges recognized under the Agreement, affecting all parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to ownership shares in a company, relevant to the Borrower's potential acquisitions of interest in other Persons."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NET MARK-TO-MARKET EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Defines the unrealized losses and profits of a Person arising from Rate Management Transactions, indicating obligations under these transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The exposure of the Person resulting from fluctuations in market value for financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDITION SATISFACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
