  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEMBERSHIP INTERESTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indicates the ownership interests in limited liability companies, significant for the Borrower's acquisition activities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS OF OTHERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Referencing liabilities incurred by third parties but potentially affecting the Person."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMAINING MATURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Remaining Maturity is the time left for the full repayment of the loan commitment after considering extensions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The overall expense associated with maintaining loans or agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"To compensate such Lender or such Issuing Lender for and hold such Lender or such Issuing Lender harmless from any loss, cost or expense incurred."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d2f0619713166fc84a2c2b0e0230d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT RETURN DEFICIENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition that arises when a payment is incorrectly applied or identified, impacting the repayment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"In the event that an Erroneous Payment (or portion thereof) is not recovered by the Administrative Agent from any Payment Recipient for any reason."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d277b1d67ae447d64c60885603bfc58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relates to the ownership of assets or interests that can be acquired by the Borrower or its Subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNPAID REIMBURSEMENT OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amounts that the Person is expected to repay related to issued letters of credit but not yet settled."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPITAL ADEQUACY REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Capital adequacy regulations refer to the rules affecting the rate of return on a Lender’s or Issuing Lender’s capital in relation to the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-52bf93d3e20b62a0cd832df66353f563</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The indemnification provisions of this Agreement ensure that each party understands its responsibilities in the event of errors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d277b1d67ae447d64c60885603bfc58d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes a transaction where the Borrower or its Subsidiaries combine with another Person, resulting in the Borrower being the surviving entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process through which a Person may be merged into the Borrower, affecting the obligations and security interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes for which the Borrower indemnifies the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes for which the borrower is obligated to indemnify the administrative agent or lender, primarily related to payments made to government authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes imposed on or with respect to any payment made by the Borrower under the agreement, highlighting tax obligations related to loan payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are covered under specific indemnity provisions within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to taxes for which the Borrower shall indemnify the Administrative Agent, Lenders, and Issuing Lenders, as outlined in the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e1f22084ac500ab1a051f7b381aa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLDING COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The holding company referenced is associated with the Lender or Issuing Lender and is affected by capital adequacy regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-52bf93d3e20b62a0cd832df66353f563</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 10.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the contract that discusses obligations, agreements, and waivers relating to Erroneous Payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REAL PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSET"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to land and any structures on it, which the Borrower may acquire for its operational needs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.06(B)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Reference to a specific section in the legal document that outlines the definition of 'Indemnitee', showcasing the agreement's structure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE OF COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation created by a Lender or Issuing Lender detailing the amounts necessary for reimbursement, serving as proof of compensation claims against the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal decision to waive claims related to Erroneous Payments received without fulfilling the contractual obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTED DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The formal signing date of the Agreement, marking its legal commencement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 9.10&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section within the loan agreement that includes restrictive provisions beneficial to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific section of the agreement outlining confidentiality arrangements protecting the Borrower’s information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reference to another section in the legal document that outlines the definition of 'Information', important for context in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 9.10 outlines the definition and handling of information received from the Borrower and its Subsidiaries regarding their businesses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 9.10 outlines the treatment of Borrower Materials and their classification as Information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ea2c276659bea1c507ce8061fac280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a78ac18a08e4ac60633a82d5e95b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee01decfe8a02e5dc4bd8b1aa7fd3855&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLDING COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities associated with Lenders or Issuing Lenders that may also need to be compensated under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBROGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The right of the Administrative Agent to assume rights from the Lender or Issuing Lender regarding Erroneous Payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTAIN DEFINED TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to specific legal definitions provided within the Agreement that detail transaction parameters and clauses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4ac05f6ad1913c40d66d2f014a76efa</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party defined in Section 9.06(b) that may be entitled to indemnification against losses according to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Indemnitee refers to parties that are protected from claims under specified conditions within the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party that is indemnified under the agreement including the Administrative Agent, Arrangers, Lenders, and their affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnitees are parties potentially seeking indemnification for losses or claims related to the transactions and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a party in the agreement that is protected from liability under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a23731f788c5c083ebf38a42584c7dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2b28c1dc4239fb1b4dc694b26a9338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcfdf8a71bd320a62004e0e384e11c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL RESERVE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Further obligations imposed on the Borrower concerning the compensation or payment to Lenders under specific circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS AT ANY TIME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any outstanding debts or amounts due resulting from the loan, relevant for claims during Default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS FOR BORROWED MONEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial arrangement and obligation the Borrower has towards funds acquired through loans or credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt incurred by the Borrower or Subsidiaries for the purpose of financing a Material Acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Definition of 'Indebtedness for Borrowed Money' according to pertinent financial obligations relating to borrowed money."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations incurred by the Borrower that are backed by collateral, under specific conditions related to the borrowing limits and asset application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations incurred by the Borrower through loans or credit arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the legal obligation of the Borrower to pay its debts, as defined in the agreement or instrument."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the obligation incurred by the Borrower and Major Subsidiaries, representing a liability to repay borrowed funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money owned by the Borrower or Major Subsidiaries that is subject to repayment under terms set out in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Indebtedness for Borrowed Money that is secured by a Lien."&lt;SEP&gt;"terms relating to amounts owed due to borrowing activities, specifically in the context of a material acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Indebtedness for Borrowed Money secured by such Lien at such time is not increased (other than by an amount equal to any related financing costs)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8682b6b632c76068654dbc45fa760d28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d48c01f13ec86692718a0f2e1aa00e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da627f496ed5b278745386e332bef7e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbc04f4bb02a514f3cd5a84a46dd521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9cd9748d004c4b865b0c54ca99b6c09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55bbee7de91bcf64aafb649099bde95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0acdd477847e0ceb3f6060dfa6826b3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ISDA DEFINITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 2006 ISDA Definitions published by the International Swaps and Derivatives Association, Inc. or any successor thereto, defining terms related to interest rate derivatives."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific sums outlined in Section 3.02 regarding compensation that the Borrower must pay to the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION OF ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Condition where Administrative Agent steps down, yet the associated obligations continue as per the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An acquisition involving significant transactions that the Borrower intends to finance with Acquisition Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Acquisition refers to significant business transactions that may trigger changes in financial covenants and conditions within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a significant transaction that is subject to the terms outlined within the definitive offer document, which can be terminated prior to consummation."&lt;SEP&gt;"any acquisition with total consideration equal to or greater than $400,000,000."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL STANDBY PRACTICES 1998&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 'International Standby Practices 1998' published by the Institute of International Banking Law &amp; Practice, Inc., defining guidelines for standby letters of credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSECTION (A)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific subsection within Section 3.02 that details certain conditions or requirements related to compensation claims from Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal modifications allowing the transfer of rights or obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An arrangement to temporarily hold proceeds from Acquisition Debt pending the completion of the Material Acquisition."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE OF A LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliate of a Lender indicates entities connected to a lender which may receive assignments under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any company related to a lender that may also provide credit facilities under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ba5dd3dff3a1a68f89de13b8aa21f2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A timeframe mentioned in the text which indicates that the Borrower must pay the Lender within fifteen (15) days after receiving a certificate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal right arising from the pledge of collateral related to the loan obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL MANDATORY REDEMPTION PROVISION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause in the Indebtedness allowing for redemption or prepayment if the Material Acquisition is not completed as outlined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENT CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Judgment Currency is the currency used for obtaining judgments in court, which may differ from the Agreement Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency defined for any judgments or payments as per the agreement, referenced in Section 15.06."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which the sum is adjudged, potentially different from the Agreement Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency used for judgment or payment in the event of disputes or defaults as specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4792b5b0b77bf53c196055d4d402e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NINE MONTHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A limitation specified in the credit agreement that restricts the Lender from seeking compensation for increased costs incurred beyond this period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUCCESSORS AND ASSIGNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause stating that the Agreement binds the parties and their legal successors or permitted parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Successors and assigns are parties that may enforce the Guarantee and other related obligations under this Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0d8174003f4772facdd639b135093a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Various transactions related to the acquisition that may include financing and refinancing activities associated with the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An aggregate amount not to exceed its L/C Commitment for the account of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"L/C Commitment refers to the obligation of an Issuing Lender to provide a Letter of Credit as part of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The L/C Commitment refers to the obligation of the Issuing Lender regarding the Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of the Issuing Lender to issue Letters of Credit for the Borrower or its Subsidiaries from time to time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af268fffead491c2994a023017c7b638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of replacing existing Indebtedness for Borrowed Money with new debt under the acquisition structure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A group of lenders participating in the issuance of a Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collective reference to all Lenders other than the applicable Issuing Lender with respect to any Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities involved in participating in the Letters of Credit as described in the payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that participate in the Letter of Credit arrangement, sharing the risk and benefiting from associated fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The collective reference to all of the Lenders other than the applicable Issuing Lender in conjunction with a Letter of Credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a575e820a47b3c2dbd1089d67ed6dfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETROACTIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This term indicates that if a Change in Law has retroactive effects, it may extend the timeframe for seeking compensation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Requirements or regulations stated in the Agreement that govern the behavior and actions of the parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The formal agreement stipulating the terms and conditions of the Material Acquisition and associated Indebtedness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C SUBLIMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific limit set on the L/C Obligations that must be adhered to by the Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum amount that the Issuing Lender is willing to commit for Letters of Credit during a specified period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESERVE RATIO REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Lender must comply with reserve ratio requirements imposed by financial regulatory authorities related to the maintenance of Commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNED AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount assigned must not be less than $25,000,000 unless otherwise consented."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e6e6633392fc0a2358006ce0dd843d1a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TENDER OFFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A method of acquiring control over the targeted assets or entities, which may require financing through the Borrower's Indebtedness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTENCE OF LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference to entities that have an outstanding or existing Letter of Credit, denoted as Existing Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6650c2933728727b65a678ab18928dea</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COSTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower shall pay additional costs determined by the Lender as necessary for compliance with reserve ratio requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Trade Date is specified in the Assignment and Assumption and is relevant for determining assignment amounts based on outstanding loans."</data>
