</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution acting as an Issuing Lender and providing credit facilities including letters of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial institution determining the Prime Rate and involved in loan pricing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific bank with roles in conducting Federal funds transactions and influencing interest rate determinations as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank in its capacity as contractual representative of the Lenders pursuant to Article 10."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank is appointed as the Administrative Agent by the Lenders and Issuing Lenders to manage the administrative functions under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to Citibank, N.A., in its individual capacity, and its successors, participating as a lender in financing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institution that acts as an Issuing Lender and Administrative Agent, except as specified in certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"an Issuer Lender acting as Administrative Agent as defined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"the entity charging the Federal Funds Rate on such day on such transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a78ac18a08e4ac60633a82d5e95b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060af3546316eae8ec7c622327912622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe12461084bb91bf3fa92e79fc2890e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0b1eebe2d58609217c8bdecde0f604c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$100,000,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMOUNT"</data>
