<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL L/C CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional L/C Currency is the specified alternative currency for reimbursement under the Letter of Credit, which may be requested by the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional L/C Currency refers to currencies that may be accepted for letters of credit that are not approved for Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional currency referenced in relation to Letters of Credit in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An additional currency option for payments within the context of a Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"An additional currency that may be used for reimbursement under the terms of the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"An additional type of currency applicable in letters of credit for payments and transactions noted in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An alternative currency applicable to Letters of Credit beyond the standard Foreign Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any extra currency that may be specified for the reimbursement of the Letter of Credit, aside from the dollar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Extra currencies recognized alongside the Dollar and Foreign Currency for Letters of Credit purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Represents any supplementary currencies used in conjunction with letters of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific currencies that may be used for Letters of Credit issued by Citibank and other agreeing Issuing Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The additional type of currency referenced for certain Letters of Credit payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"a supplementary currency used for Letters of Credit beyond the primary currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"any currency that may be accepted for Letters of Credit issued by certain Issuing Lenders upon mutual agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"referring to currencies that may be used for Letters of Credit as approved per Section 1.05."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0a8f315e0d4cc8cd2accfbbe5da06a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f248cd4e812b91a37d2ecd4ea05ab17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec8822f0ae2be723af299c5930b2ed8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c87b9e7043c61cd132d4af9cb79a608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f007ed84b09aaafd346209ff90f4b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a52ff11a1589fe75d0346ef535d42ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505094570d348d1eb98341b07550afb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc596f8efd3d960e41a0c7ead13fb1fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da412b37f50503895e084a2932cc427</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LETTER OF CREDIT APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal request submitted by the Borrower to initiate the process of issuing a Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"An application requesting issuance, extension, or increase of a Letter of Credit by the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The application process for a Letter of Credit, detailing the terms and amounts guaranteed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The application process for obtaining a Letter of Credit under the credit facilities outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal request submitted by the Borrower to the Issuing Lender to initiate the issuance of a Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"the application process for securing a Letter of Credit from an Issuing Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc596f8efd3d960e41a0c7ead13fb1fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b5bfafb78d3fba9840d96ce7e8fc410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN DEMAND&quot;">
