  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT OF RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A modification to the original agreement allowing the transfer of rights and obligations among the involved parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e08590c6f860ab659cec13d7e2426aa7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Affiliate of a Lender can receive assignments without a minimum amount requirement during the assignment process."&lt;SEP&gt;"An associated entity or group affiliated with a Lender or Issuing Lender, potentially influencing credit conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that is related to the Lender or Issuing Lender, often involved in the contractual agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any party related to the Lenders, usually in a parent-subsidiary relationship, that can incur liabilities under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities affiliated with the Administrative Agent and Arrangers that play a role in the Agreement's execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Affiliate is a related entity to the banks that can serve as a successor Administrative Agent, based on their qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"an entity that is connected to a Lender through ownership or control, impacting financial relations."&lt;SEP&gt;"describes entities that are controlled by or have common control with a person, characterized by ownership interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2b28c1dc4239fb1b4dc694b26a9338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9380e9db9ff5b3fc2108e49aa5e7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6633392fc0a2358006ce0dd843d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbd5056a9b1d822dcccb189f309820c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE INFORMATION SHEETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents provided by the Lenders detailing their operational offices or branches related to the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PENALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GENERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Charges imposed by authorities on the Borrower related to tax compliance failures or delays in payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sanctions or fines imposed for the failure to meet tax obligations or other regulatory requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81dca06289b2b356d8d67f8d32f94928</data>
