<node id="&quot;REVOLVING BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit arrangement allowing for the borrower to withdraw, repay, and borrow again."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of credit that allows the Borrower to withdraw, repay, and withdraw again up to a set limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Revolving Borrowing made under this Section 2.01(a) shall consist of Revolving Loans made from the several Lenders in accordance with their respective Pro Rata Shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"means a type of borrowing arrangement allowing for advances and repayments under predefined conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509c304656080c8e86ce3cd455d89065</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAJOR SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Major Subsidiary refers to significant subsidiaries of the Borrower that hold material obligations under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant subsidiary of the Borrower that may also incur indebtedness for Borrowed Money and share obligations under the lease agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant subsidiary of the Borrower that participates in transactions and financing activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to significant subsidiaries that can impact financial and operational obligations, particularly those that are Guarantors."&lt;SEP&gt;"any subsidiary of the Borrower which has significant total assets exceeding 10% of Consolidated Assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower will not, and will not permit any Major Subsidiary to create or suffer to exist any Lien in or on any of its Property."&lt;SEP&gt;"the incurrence and existence of such Lien shall not be prohibited or restricted by, and shall not reduce availability under any clause of this Section 6.11 upon such Subsidiary subsequently becoming a Major Subsidiary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57790ed9c8601659e5a900ae22c9e87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d48c01f13ec86692718a0f2e1aa00e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbc04f4bb02a514f3cd5a84a46dd521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55bbee7de91bcf64aafb649099bde95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8682b6b632c76068654dbc45fa760d28</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
