<node id="&quot;SECTION 1.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"...Amend the definition of 'Foreign Currency' or Section 1.05 without the consent of all Lenders..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 1.05 outlines changes regarding currency approvals, which may require modification to accommodate additional currencies under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"pertains to definitions and approvals related to currency usage in conjunction with Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"the section that outlines the approval of Foreign Currencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-626e172089dfc80733dbdc3d5a655994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe12461084bb91bf3fa92e79fc2890e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f1be3cca81841828b69a682f741856e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
