<node id="&quot;REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A maintained list by the Administrative Agent which records the names and addresses of the Lenders, their Commitments, and principal amounts pertaining to the Loans and L/C Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entries in the Register shall be conclusive, absent manifest error, and the Borrower, the Administrative Agent and the Lenders may treat each Person whose name is recorded in the Register as a Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e3e5cabd1adf8bfb109a8c35cc714a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f8540eaf8f40e45748d1788b0ef6de</data>
