</node>
<node id="&quot;SEPTEMBER 22, 2025&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"the date mentioned for certain activities related to the repayment or termination of commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fb44d7769bde7d6f8440869a5a341430</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Guarantor is an entity that guarantees the obligations of the Borrower under the Agreement, ensuring compliance and repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Guarantor is an entity that guarantees the obligations of the Borrower, ensuring payment of the Guaranteed Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that guarantees the obligations of the Borrower under the Loan Documents after the Effective Date through customary joinder documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Guarantor acknowledges that it will receive direct and indirect benefits from the financing arrangements contemplated by this Agreement and its Guarantee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Guarantor irrevocably waives any claims or other rights that it may now or hereafter acquire against the Borrower under its Guarantee."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor guarantees that the Guaranteed Obligations will be paid strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a subsidiary or entity that guarantees the obligations of the Borrower under the Loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57790ed9c8601659e5a900ae22c9e87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51e0b942fc38bb2172bde4cb6d8e8480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0d8174003f4772facdd639b135093a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b24f224a12be42ba1f1dbc4b72037c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-904c0cc387dffe2b87a7d3f92f2a414f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-175c18fb247e3700a956581f912d57df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
