</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTIEMPLOYER PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal arrangement requiring contributions from Borrowers and subsidiaries based on withdrawal liability or contributions that may affect financial stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A multiemployer plan into which the Borrower or its Subsidiaries may be obligated to make contributions or has liability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A plan in which multiple employers contribute to provide pension benefits for their employees, impacted by the Borrower's obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employee benefit plan that is established through multiple contributing employers for their employees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b75c230455e9616a385ea8bda68b04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937</data>
