<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A promissory note that evidences the Loans made by the Lender and the obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the legal document that outlines the terms of the loan as defined in Section 2.13(e)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note may refer to the specific documentation related to the loan provided by the Lender in accordance with the agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Note requested from the Borrower in writing at least five (5) Business Days prior to the Closing Date by any Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8c546287864ea4d788574dbe3580df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca785d11c173b114c75a86d24a9c1982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de</data>
