<node id="&quot;MINIMUM COLLATERAL AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined amount relating to the cash or deposit account balances required to secure Letters of Credit as determined by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minimum Collateral Amount is a threshold that the Borrower must maintain to fulfill their collateral requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Minimum Collateral Amount is the least amount of collateral that must be maintained to secure the loan under the specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum amount required to be maintained as cash collateral for obligations associated with a Defaulting Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ef03c2a3bc83b467c592d30c98456018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03b2d3addc3724118fcaa9cbe2d864f0</data>
