<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lender that is in good standing and does not have any defaults under its obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that is not categorized as a Defaulting Lender, indicating their commitment to the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that continues to meet its financial obligations despite the presence of a Defaulting Lender, having the right to participate in the reallocation of credit exposures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that continue to fulfill their obligations despite others being classified as Defaulting Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6</data>
