<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Agent manages the administrative functions related to the credit agreement, acting on behalf of the Lenders and Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for managing administrative functions related to the loan on behalf of lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities listed on the cover page responsible for managing loan functions and responsibilities as clarified within specific sections of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notwithstanding the foregoing, no amendment of any provision of this Agreement relating to any Agent shall be effective without the written consent of such Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any of the Administrative Agent, the Arrangers, or the Co-Syndication Agents involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that manages administrative loan functions and notifies of reductions in commitments."</data>
