  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agents are entities managing the administrative functions related to the loan agreement, acting on behalf of lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agents manage administrative functions and rights under the Loan Documents related to Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity managing administrative loan functions, referenced in the context of jurisdiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the Borrower, the Agents, the Issuing Lenders and the Lenders hereby agrees further that service of all process..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities acting on behalf of lenders within the agreement, managing various aspects of the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities authorized to act on behalf of the Lender, performing various administrative tasks related to the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals managing administrative functions related to the loans provided under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower represents and warrants as follows to each Lender and the Agents as of the Closing Date and thereafter on each date as required by Section 4.03."&lt;SEP&gt;"The respective obligations of the Lenders and the Issuing Lenders hereunder are several and not joint and no Lender or Issuing Lender shall be the partner or agent of any other."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4438bf9135054e1ff77226fc332e8268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cfcb4f8a699443d740caa150eba6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50dc3791859bd42e6b79be8ac39d58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f7f879e70c1c09e23862d87cf18c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9380e9db9ff5b3fc2108e49aa5e7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebd046b77e404961bb2e85f280bf3765&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c42000811c18c4fe1fb14e6839c213</data>
