<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's obligation to provide financing within the specified limits outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aggregate Commitment refers to the total financial commitment of the Lenders under the Revolving Credit Facility, representing their total lending capacity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the limit concerning the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure as described above."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the total sum of commitments made by lenders under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum financial commitment that may not be exceeded when considering outstanding credit exposures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total aggregate commitment outlined in the document is $800,000,000.00, allocated among various lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount available to the Borrower under the credit agreement, which can be increased by written notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount committed by the Lenders to provide Revolving Loans, subject to reduction notices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount committed by the lenders to provide loans, subject to adjustments and reductions as stated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of commitments made by all lenders at any given time, amounting to Eight Hundred Million Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit available under the lending agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of financing available to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of funds that lenders agree to provide to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that can be borrowed, which cannot exceed the Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that can be drawn under the agreement which is subject to limitations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that lenders are obligated to provide under the agreement, subject to reduction rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total commitment amount agreed upon by the lenders to be available to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb6e2d4916072445b0d7943e6df0abe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7da74967a1a961b1ef138e5868347ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc38152b0f228851eb2001881889cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3c1b09c7a3b24aa925d3f14133dc8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f11027b6de40e5187e572c3471f052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509c304656080c8e86ce3cd455d89065&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee01decfe8a02e5dc4bd8b1aa7fd3855</data>
