<node id="&quot;ARRANGERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities involved in structuring the loan agreement and coordinating between the Borrower and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities involved in the arrangement of the Loans and administrative role, benefiting along with their Affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities involved in the structuring and arrangement of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities responsible for managing the arrangement of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities responsible for structuring the loan and coordinating among involved parties, referenced in terms of their limited duties under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that help facilitate the loan agreement and manage the distribution of Borrower Materials to Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties responsible for arranging the particulars of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties responsible for organizing the loan syndication and negotiating terms for the lender group."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arrangers are involved in the transaction as agents but have no advisory obligations to the Borrower or its Affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arrangers help facilitate the administration of Loans and Commitments under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"entities such as Citibank, N.A., Barclays Bank PLC, and Crédit Agricole, acting as Joint Lead Arrangers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c14c7925e4a607de0382cb8d2225da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3c1b09c7a3b24aa925d3f14133dc8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9653286dcc9ab1fd5889964b3252c74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87fd223bdbce8cbc5531c412e0930ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d5badee5a4510f96230df4661d245d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee99ae045b011273b805e2d9acdc4dd6</data>
