<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE OUTSTANDING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Shall not exceed the Aggregate Commitments after payments to Declining Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure shall not exceed the Aggregate Commitment at any time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The balance of Aggregate Outstanding Credit Exposure cannot exceed the Aggregate Commitment after a Letter of Credit issuance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit exposure that must be managed in accordance to the commitments made by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit outstanding under the agreement that the Borrower is liable for."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total outstanding debt of the borrowers under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total outstanding obligations under the loan, which limits the reduction of the Aggregate Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total current outstanding amounts owed by the Borrower to all Lenders at any given time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fb6e2d4916072445b0d7943e6df0abe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3c1b09c7a3b24aa925d3f14133dc8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509c304656080c8e86ce3cd455d89065&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78df53bf404a8c04f30aed8e096f054</data>
