  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guidelines determining how leases and financial obligations are accounted for in financial statements, relevant within the context of the Agreement and GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principles under which net income is determined for the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the standard accounting principles applicable to agreements, highlighting the importance of proper accounting definitions used in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Set of accounting standards that the Borrower must adhere to in financial reporting, as defined under GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specifications defining accounting principles relevant to the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standards for reporting obligations on the consolidated balance sheet, tied to financial conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3c1b09c7a3b24aa925d3f14133dc8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-455f5d24af85e0e01ce99360a0fe0f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b5bfafb78d3fba9840d96ce7e8fc410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7db23745e08dce95f931014f491b519</data>
