  <data key="d1">"A fluctuating interest rate defined in relation to the Federal Funds Rate, Prime Rate, and Eurocurrency Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate that impacts the accrued interest on Alternate Base Rate Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used for calculating advances denominated in US Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b3c1b09c7a3b24aa925d3f14133dc8f</data>
