<node id="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs incurred by Lenders or Issuing Lenders in relation to their credit obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Costs incurred by the Administrative Agent and Lenders in managing the loan process and claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"Costs incurred by the Administrative Agent, Arrangers, and Lenders in relation to the Agreement and syndication efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Costs incurred by the entities in connection with the enforcement or protection of their rights under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Costs incurred, including legal fees, associated with managing tax-related claims or liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Costs that may be chargeable to the Borrower as defined within the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower shall have paid all fees, costs and expenses due and payable to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443cceb6eea0f4b1688789c95181be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8c546287864ea4d788574dbe3580df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2b28c1dc4239fb1b4dc694b26a9338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd9380e9db9ff5b3fc2108e49aa5e7d0</data>
