  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notices and other communications are integral components of the credit agreement, outlining how information should be shared among the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notices include communications that may be sent to the Lenders and are integral to the credit agreement process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a248a4d561291c597b0a80f7d7b6b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984b41314faeae1eec3c3d4885dafca</data>
