<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined interest rate benchmark that influences loan pricing as detailed in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Base Rate means the rate per annum equal to the London Interbank Offered Rate administered by the ICE Benchmark Administration (or the successor thereto)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Part of the calculation for the Alternate Base Rate applicable for loans denominated in Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of interest used for Eurocurrency Loans, reflecting the cost of borrowing in the Eurocurrency market."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Eurocurrency Rate” means, with respect to a Eurocurrency Advance..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-660ba35b7b2352a6dcf5d1814a86b611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e</data>
