  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal assertions or demands made by Governmental Authorities regarding tax obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal claims that may arise against the Indemnitee as a result of the Borrower's obligations and related expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal demands or assertions for payment that can arise under the Debt or obligations owed by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The demands or assertions made by Indemnitees regarding obligations or losses related to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"claims refer to potential legal actions the Borrower agrees not to pursue against the Administrative Agent, Arrangers, and Lenders regarding agency or fiduciary duties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2b28c1dc4239fb1b4dc694b26a9338&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
