  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collectively refers to the Administrative Agent and its related parties, involved in facilitating the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agent Parties are defined within the agreement and are responsible for managing administrative functions and communication between the borrower and lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a248a4d561291c597b0a80f7d7b6b35</data>
