  <data key="d1">"A specific clause pertaining to early opt-in elections related to interest rates that may affect the loan agreement under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Other Rate Early Opt-in Election is an option allowing for early transition to a new Benchmark based on specific conditions."</data>
