<node id="&quot;ALTERNATE BASE RATE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan or portion thereof that bears interest at the Alternate Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that is tied to a specified base interest rate, from which the Borrower can take out loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"for any interest calculation with respect to an Alternate Base Rate Loan..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional taxes that may be attributed to the lender or issuing lender, requiring indemnification by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional types of taxes that may be applicable but are excluded from certain agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations that arise from the execution or enforcement of the agreement, including potential stamp or documentary taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Other Taxes refers to additional tax obligations that the Borrower must pay to the relevant Governmental Authority in compliance with applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Similar to Taxes, it relates to additional financial obligations that may incur expenses for the borrower's account."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes other than Indemnified Taxes that may be imposed or asserted on or attributable to amounts payable under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-81dca06289b2b356d8d67f8d32f94928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e1f22084ac500ab1a051f7b381aa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NUMEROUS SUPPORTING DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to additional documents that must accompany tax forms to validate the foreign lender's claims under U.S. tax laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b82ab4e4820c45842359419fd730cea8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WARRANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Warranty refers to the assurances or guarantees that the Agent Parties explicitly disavow regarding the completeness or accuracy of Borrower Materials under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a248a4d561291c597b0a80f7d7b6b35</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTI-CORRUPTION LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anti-Corruption Laws are legal statutes aimed at preventing bribery and corruption in business practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anti-Corruption Laws refer to legal statutes that prohibit corruption and bribery, which the Borrower must comply with."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws concerning bribery, money laundering, or corruption applicable to the Borrower or Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower commits to maintain policies and procedures to ensure compliance with Anti-Corruption Laws, which is a significant responsibility outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f0b98aec52fb64b5625c54126b83ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f7f879e70c1c09e23862d87cf18c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OUTSTANDING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The current outstanding amount owed by the Borrower under any credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The measurement of a Lender's total risk exposure related to outstanding loans and obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of credit exposure that stands against the Non-Defaulting Lender's allocated Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total amount of credit extended that remains unpaid at any given time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTNERSHIP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal entity structure that refers to a business arrangement where two or more individuals manage and operate a business with shared profits and losses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower (a) is a corporation, partnership, limited liability company or other entity duly and properly incorporated or organized."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e0fd11a77b1736d9bcb7a218768fc0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cfcb4f8a699443d740caa150eba6f3</data>
