</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE OF ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A procedural covenant allowing each party to modify their contact information for proper communication related to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MARGIN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The additional percentage added to the base rate in calculating the Letter of Credit Fee for Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The additional percentage that is applied to the base rate in determining the effective interest rate for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage rate applicable to Advances as set forth in the Pricing Schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate per annum that is added to the Alternate Base Rate to determine the applicable interest rates for Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific interest rate added to the base rate that determines the total cost of borrowing under various pricing levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"the percentage added to the base rate applicable to the Advances as set forth in the Pricing Schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d48279d43f206b73878812648979f0eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Designated dates for payment due under the loan agreement, occurring quarterly at the end of March, June, September, and December."&lt;SEP&gt;"Means the last Business Day of each March, June, September and December and the Facility Termination Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific dates outlined in the agreement for payment of interest and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the issuance fee for the Letter of Credit is payable quarterly in arrears."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dates on which payments are required to be made according to the loan agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which payments, including commissions for the Letter of Credit, are due to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d40b4e9dc14bb67b22b82308d7b947</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
