  <data key="d2">chunk-8e0fd11a77b1736d9bcb7a218768fc0d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDIRECT DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIABILITIES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Types of damages that are not direct losses but may arise in connection with the agreement or actions of Agent Parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVE ADDRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An accurately updated communication address for each party involved in the loan to ensure proper notifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"An effective address for notices ensures proper communication channels between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984b41314faeae1eec3c3d4885dafca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOLLARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference to the currency in which Advances may be denominated and in which Borrowers may choose to receive funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authority of such Lender to purchase or sell, or to take deposits of, Dollars or any Foreign Currency in the London interbank market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Denominated amount in Dollars referenced in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dollars refer to the currency in which Eurocurrency Loans can be denominated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Letters of Credit may be denominated in Dollars or other specified foreign currencies as agreed in the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency denomination for Eurocurrency Loans when denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which certain loans and payments are denominated as specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency referenced in the description of the various interest rates and loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific currency in which an Advance may be made when no other currency is specified by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2f0619713166fc84a2c2b0e0230d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436dbc8e8c3aea78e296e758404cb6e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f137654576242955bbe95a3196a220e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da412b37f50503895e084a2932cc427</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Participant is an entity that has a financial interest in the loan participation sold by the Lender and is involved in the credit agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that has acquired an interest in the loans or obligations under the Loan Documents and is entitled to certain rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that holds an interest in the loan document and has obligations related to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that takes part in the lending arrangement, potentially acquiring rights and obligations related to the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender may at any time, without the prior written consent of the Borrower, sell participations to any Person (other than a natural person)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined in Section 12.01(d) as a party involved in the context of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ea2c276659bea1c507ce8061fac280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b81ad32680319d4fa9bb79e2517486d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca785d11c173b114c75a86d24a9c1982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f8540eaf8f40e45748d1788b0ef6de</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORTFOLIO INTEREST EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A tax exemption that allows certain investors to earn interest income without being subject to U.S. withholding tax."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e0fd11a77b1736d9bcb7a218768fc0d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TELEPHONE NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A telephone number is required for direct communication with the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contact information necessary for ensuring that all parties can communicate effectively regarding the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984b41314faeae1eec3c3d4885dafca</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advances refer to the amounts lent to the Borrower under the terms of the agreement for its use in corporate activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to loans or amounts that are provided under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advances consist of various types of loans such as Alternate Base Rate Loans or Eurocurrency Loans provided by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"the funds or resources made available to the Borrower for obtaining financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A record that maintains details about each Participant in the lending arrangement, ensuring transparency and compliance with loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A record that must be maintained by the lender or issuing lender to ensure proper documentation and compliance as per the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A register maintained by the Lender detailing names, addresses, and principal amounts of each Participant's interests in the loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined in Section 12.01(d) as a record of participants in the context of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant Register is a record that maintains details of participants in the loan agreement, but the Administrative Agent is not responsible for its maintenance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b81ad32680319d4fa9bb79e2517486d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca785d11c173b114c75a86d24a9c1982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECT PARTNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual or entity that directly participates in the partnership and has obligations towards the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e0fd11a77b1736d9bcb7a218768fc0d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNITED STATES FEDERAL AND STATE SECURITIES LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal frameworks governing securities transactions which the Public Lender must comply with."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d984b41314faeae1eec3c3d4885dafca</data>
