</node>
<node id="&quot;REVOLVING LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Revolving Loan allows the Borrower to borrow, repay, and borrow again, providing flexibility in accessing loan funds as needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan arrangement providing the Borrower with the ability to borrow and repay multiple times."&lt;SEP&gt;"A short-term borrowing facility that the Lenders provide, utilized for reimbursing the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement where the Lenders provide funds to the Borrower, which can be drawn down and repaid repeatedly."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the Borrower to draw funds, repay them, and borrow again as needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the borrower to draw, repay, and redraw from the available credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the borrower to withdraw, repay, and borrow again up to a set limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Revolving Borrowing means a borrowing hereunder consisting of the aggregate amount of several Revolving Loans made by the Lenders on the same Borrowing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Revolving Loan is the financial product involved in Advances provided to the Borrower through the Administrative Agent, which is part of the overall credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"a loan facility that allows the Borrower to withdraw, repay, and withdraw again."&lt;SEP&gt;"a type of loan that allows the Borrower to withdraw, repay, and borrow again up to a predetermined limit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f248cd4e812b91a37d2ecd4ea05ab17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f1cbe5d37f2115e7fdee4a6fef2330&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c87b9e7043c61cd132d4af9cb79a608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505094570d348d1eb98341b07550afb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d40b4e9dc14bb67b22b82308d7b947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT RECIPIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity that is entitled to receive payments as per the Loan Agreement, but has certain waivers regarding Erroneous Payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any other Payment Recipient that receives funds on its respective behalf shall promptly notify the Administrative Agent of its receipt of such payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any recipient who has received funds on behalf of a Lender or Issuing Lender, excluding the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined in Section 10.11(a) as the party entitled to receive payments under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity receiving payments or funds from the Administrative Agent on behalf of others."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d277b1d67ae447d64c60885603bfc58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2312b6c1d8ad4b95ad6661f4fa1b286f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDIRECT PARTNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual or entity that has a relationship with the partnership but is not directly within it; still bound to obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e0fd11a77b1736d9bcb7a218768fc0d</data>
