<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.11&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the agreement that includes specific provisions related to the terms of the loan or advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.11 addresses the default rate of interest applicable in event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section of the agreement that specifies the rates applicable after a Default is declared."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-edf07809d1746fad0fc15e800a6e13c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
