<node id="&quot;PBGC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation, a U.S. government agency that protects pension benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation, or any successor, likely in a role of ensuring benefit obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation, overseeing retirement benefits, which could impact financial and credit-related obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd6d2a03e6e0fe0536790ef81febaf9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3679e0426d9ba539d7a46289e2bab63a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937</data>
