<node id="&quot;PERMITTED REFINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Permitted Refinancing refers to the conditions under which the Borrower may refinance existing debts without violating Agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to specific conditions under which existing indebtedness can be refinanced according to the definitions provided in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Permitted Refinancing of any Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money specified in clause (i)."</data>
