  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payments made by the Borrower to indemnify the Lender for liabilities incurred due to taxes withheld."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payments owed to the retiring or removed Administrative Agent, potentially affecting the transition to a successor agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f946a950865efa69f83d6930d5a5ebef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81dca06289b2b356d8d67f8d32f94928</data>
