<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A general term used to indicate the cost of borrowing money, as referenced in various contexts in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Alternate Base Rate Advance shall bear interest at a rate equal to the Alternate Base Rate plus other elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate that applies to any unreimbursed amount drawn under the Letter of Credit, affecting the total cost for the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7f248cd4e812b91a37d2ecd4ea05ab17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d35133a09e796f51c620fe44c317a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-303d4111dcc6924456507f281b537f2e</data>
