<node id="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RATING"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Means the public credit rating for the Borrower’s senior unsecured, long-term debt without third-party credit enhancement by S&amp;P and Fitch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Debt Rating associated with the pricing levels in the Revolving Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public Debt Ratings are assessed by S&amp;P and Fitch for any debt obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Public Debt Rating refers to the borrower's credit rating required by lenders and indicated that the Borrower has received a necessary rating of BBB- or better from credit rating agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ratings assigned by credit agencies such as S&amp;P and Fitch to determine applicable margins and commitment fees under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928c9ed4796f36d4046ab5434f4288c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f11027b6de40e5187e572c3471f052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d48279d43f206b73878812648979f0eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5cae935d5ac1c45cef47e54948aebca</data>
