<node id="&quot;ASSIGNEE GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Concurrent assignments to members of an Assignee Group will be treated as a single assignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignee Group consists of multiple Eligible Assignees involved in the assignment process in relation to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"groups of Eligible Assignees that are either Affiliates of one another or managed by the same investment advisor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f7ba5dd3dff3a1a68f89de13b8aa21f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78a94bb2c8dc099ee3742dd06619dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6633392fc0a2358006ce0dd843d1a</data>
