</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION X&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulation X is another regulatory guideline that pertains to certain types of lending and must be followed by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation X means Regulation X of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System as from time to time in effect and any successor or other regulation or official interpretation of said Board of Governors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation X of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System is involved in setting regulations related to credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd6d2a03e6e0fe0536790ef81febaf9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55f0c9708e0c2a6fd25d8fab0cb14da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb</data>
