<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities associated with the Administrative Agent that may have roles or responsibilities regarding the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals related to a Person, including Affiliates and directors, involved in the contractual agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities related to the Administrative Agent and Lenders, affecting decisions made in the context of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties related to the Administrative Agent and Lenders that may have rights under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties include entities connected to the Administrative Agent that may assist in executing its duties while being protected by exculpatory provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties of the Administrative Agent include associated entities or individuals who may have a shared interest or involvement in the administrative functions of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Related Parties of each Lender are included in indemnification clauses related to notice reliance."</data>
