<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"...shall bear interest for the applicable period plus the Applicable Margin..."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined duration between interest payment dates in the context of syndicated loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined period during which the interest rate for a Eurocurrency Loan is set."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specified duration for which an interest rate is fixed, typically used in loan agreements to outline interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period is the timeframe set for the accrual of interest on loans, determined by market conventions in relation to currency changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the duration applicable to the Eurocurrency Advance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the timeframe over which interest is calculated for Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the specific duration over which interest calculations are made in relation to the benchmark rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The defined duration for a Eurocurrency Advance concerning loan repayments, agreed upon by the Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated time frame during which the interest rate for a Eurocurrency Advance remains fixed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duration for which the interest on an advance is calculated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duration for which the interest rate of a loan is determined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The last day of the Interest Period for such Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified duration for which a Eurocurrency Advance is applicable, influencing repayment terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time duration for which the interest rate is applicable to the Revolving Loan before it needs to be reviewed or recalibrated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time duration for which the interest rate on a loan is fixed, typically relevant for Revolving Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timeframe in which interest is calculated and payments are due."&lt;SEP&gt;"the term equivalent to such Interest Period; (iii) denominated in Canadian dollars..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eb2d822d34cd4895bb4832559ec6c10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c87b9e7043c61cd132d4af9cb79a608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f1be3cca81841828b69a682f741856e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326b98774b8aee4a0b25dfe50758ad4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d35133a09e796f51c620fe44c317a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2f0619713166fc84a2c2b0e0230d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-660ba35b7b2352a6dcf5d1814a86b611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ff3410f6697f7d5609929e33fcaa0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436dbc8e8c3aea78e296e758404cb6e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
