<node id="&quot;RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority responsible for the resolution of failed financial institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for overseeing and managing the resolution of failing institutions in financial markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority responsible for overseeing actions such as Bail-In Actions concerning affected financial institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for applying Write-Down and Conversion Powers to liabilities of affected financial institutions under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The regulatory body responsible for overseeing and applying Write-Down and Conversion Powers to financial institutions."</data>
