<node id="&quot;AFFILIATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliates refer to any related entities associated with the Borrower or Lenders involved in various capacities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to entities related to the Borrower, which may have interests differing from those of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to entities that have relationships with the Borrower and may hold investments, loans, or other engagements with it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities associated with the Administrative Agent that are involved in the management of loans and payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities associated with the Borrower, recognized within the context of transactions and advisory roles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities connected or associated with a Person, which could influence contractual agreements and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities connected or associated with the Administrative Agent and Arrangers, benefiting from the execution of the Loans and Agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or businesses that are connected to the Borrower but are not allowed to receive assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related entities or individuals associated with the Borrower that may also be affected by the Borrower's actions or information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Affiliates of the Administrative Agent refer to associated entities that may influence or participate in the actions or decisions of the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term Affiliates defines related entities or corporations that are involved in the financing agreements under the context of Lender parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower or any of its Affiliates or Subsidiaries cannot be a Participant in the sale of participations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7ca92fb46e43aac35741ad94be06baf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c14c7925e4a607de0382cb8d2225da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e08590c6f860ab659cec13d7e2426aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52a3e836c8b1039ab574b4d21c75c56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87fd223bdbce8cbc5531c412e0930ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6d2a03e6e0fe0536790ef81febaf9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a78ac18a08e4ac60633a82d5e95b9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49d5badee5a4510f96230df4661d245d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2312b6c1d8ad4b95ad6661f4fa1b286f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f8540eaf8f40e45748d1788b0ef6de</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
