  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The governmental officer is an official responsible for certifying the Borrower’s certificate of incorporation and good standing."&lt;SEP&gt;"certified by the appropriate governmental officer in its jurisdiction of incorporation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8c546287864ea4d788574dbe3580df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197</data>
