<node id="&quot;EURIBOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A commonly used benchmark for interest rates on Eurocurrency Loans denominated in Euro."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference rate used in the Eurozone, being evaluated for its future use in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined as part of the Eurocurrency Base Rate, a reference interest rate applicable in the European monetary system."&lt;SEP&gt;"EURIBOR is determined by the European Money Market Institute and represents the rate at which interbank deposits in Euros are being offered."&lt;SEP&gt;"EURIBOR is the benchmark interest rate for amounts denominated in Euro, serving as a critical reference for financial products linked to Euro loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Euro Interbank Offered Rate, a benchmark interest rate for Euro-denominated loans referenced in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Euro Interbank Offered Rate, potentially involved in fallback elections in the context of syndicated credit facilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98873f0978b82c2fd29714e88f71122d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5807ed590c9a7272d374bb401a2dc73b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f137654576242955bbe95a3196a220e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d92f3ae85f5d9dc7cd636aa2549b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da412b37f50503895e084a2932cc427</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
