<node id="&quot;CDOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark for interest rates on Eurocurrency Loans denominated in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Another reference interest rate that is being considered in the process of Benchmark Replacement under this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"CDOR is the benchmark interest rate for Canadian Dollars, often used in financial contracts for determining costs of borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, another possible benchmark referenced in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Canadian reference interest rate applied within the context of Eurocurrency Advances, impacting repayment terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, another benchmark referenced for possible replacement in the context of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98873f0978b82c2fd29714e88f71122d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5807ed590c9a7272d374bb401a2dc73b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da412b37f50503895e084a2932cc427&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f137654576242955bbe95a3196a220e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d92f3ae85f5d9dc7cd636aa2549b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.03(F)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision within the agreement related to reimbursements for Letters of Credit denominated in foreign currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific section in the credit agreement detailing the mechanics of reimbursement for Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonpayment of (a) principal of any Loan when due or the Borrower’s obligation under Section 2.03(f)..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd6d2a03e6e0fe0536790ef81febaf9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23cc38126f5fc772e7c16a84edaa089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2</data>
