</node>
<node id="&quot;SUM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CAPITAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount of money adjudged to be due, referenced in relation to currency transactions in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"sum refers to the amounts due under the Loan Documents that the Borrower is obligated to pay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4792b5b0b77bf53c196055d4d402e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b</data>
