</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A modification or addition to existing agreements related to replacing benchmarks that may no longer be available or representative."&lt;SEP&gt;"A replacement for the benchmark interest rate for syndicated loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A substitute for the Benchmark that the Borrower and Administrative Agent will manage the transition to after a notice of its implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement defines the alternative benchmarks applicable when initial benchmarks are replaced under specific conditions outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement provides alternative rates to be used when original benchmark rates are no longer applicable or available."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to the new benchmark replacing LIBOR for all purposes under the Agreement and Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to the new interest rate that replaces LIBOR in the event of its discontinuation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The replacement for existing benchmark rates in credit agreements, determined by regulatory bodies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eb2d822d34cd4895bb4832559ec6c10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98873f0978b82c2fd29714e88f71122d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6cc6030818dd3429d755aaf140adc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5807ed590c9a7272d374bb401a2dc73b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd6d2a03e6e0fe0536790ef81febaf9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b7d377704d41cd539f04a2c3d2a312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3501bf74ffa65326e0d3555b82f8a65d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CENTRAL BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The national bank responsible for monetary policy and acting as the issuer of currency in the economy, relevant to interest rates in credit agreements."</data>
