<node id="&quot;GUARANTEED OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Guaranteed Obligations include all amounts payable under the Guarantor's Guarantee and any related terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranteed Obligations refer to all amounts owed that remain outstanding after the Facility Termination Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranteed Obligations refer to all obligations of the Borrower under the Loan Documents, including repayments for principal, interest, fees, and expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranteed Obligations refer to the financial responsibilities that the Guarantor is warranting will be fulfilled under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The collective obligations of the Borrower guaranteed by Guarantors as set forth in the Article regarding guarantees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-51e0b942fc38bb2172bde4cb6d8e8480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0d8174003f4772facdd639b135093a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b24f224a12be42ba1f1dbc4b72037c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-904c0cc387dffe2b87a7d3f92f2a414f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-175c18fb247e3700a956581f912d57df</data>
