<node id="&quot;REQUEST FOR CREDIT EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal request related to credit, which includes provisions for Revolving Borrowing and the issuance of a Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Request for Credit Extension is the Borrower's request for additional financing, subject to conditions related to defaults and representations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d610724a0ad4c9bf19e1e6f7531d7eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197</data>
