<node id="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each of Borrower and its Subsidiaries has timely filed or caused to be filed all Tax returns and reports required to have been filed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities responsible for overseeing compliance and regulations concerning payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations that may arise concerning payments made to government authorities by the borrower or the administrative agent in compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations that may arise from claims linked to the Borrower under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial obligations that must be considered for payments made to the Lender or Issuing Lender by the Borrower under the Agreement, impacting net payment amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"General reference to any taxes that may be withheld or deducted from payments under the Loan Document, requiring compliance by both the Borrower and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Includes all present or future taxes, levies, imposts, and charges imposed by any Governmental Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to amounts withheld or deducted from funds paid for the account of lenders; related to the financial obligations of both lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has an obligation to pay all imposed Taxes and governmental charges unless contested in good faith."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e9164310bb510717cd7cd3ab94e1d97c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81dca06289b2b356d8d67f8d32f94928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f0b98aec52fb64b5625c54126b83ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3679e0426d9ba539d7a46289e2bab63a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e1f22084ac500ab1a051f7b381aa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ad4aee590c35f13996d66a7065a0103</data>
