<node id="&quot;CAPITALIZED LEASE OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial obligations related to capitalized leases as defined in the agreement, with implications for the Borrower’s compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long-term obligations resulting from leases that are recorded as assets and liabilities on the balance sheet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations classified under GAAP that do not require cash payment from the Borrower or its Subsidiaries, highlighting the financial responsibilities of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations for property leases that must be capitalized on the balance sheet."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Borrower under Capitalized Leases shown as liabilities on their financial statements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3</data>
