</node>
<node id="&quot;GAAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"GAAP refers to Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, which dictate how the Borrower must maintain their accounting records."&lt;SEP&gt;"GAAP refers to the Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, which the Borrower’s financial statements are prepared under."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles referred to in the agreement, which the Borrower must comply with for financial reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles that govern the accounting standards applicable to the Borrower and its subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the standard framework of guidelines for financial accounting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, which govern the accounting treatment of leases and financial reporting in the United States as of January 31, 2018."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally accepted accounting principles in the United States of America."&lt;SEP&gt;"a system of accounting established and administered in accordance with GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4624e829973bed7d3dbe1f2bc639fd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f0b98aec52fb64b5625c54126b83ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7db23745e08dce95f931014f491b519</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUESTED CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"requested currency refers to the specific foreign currency in which Eurocurrency Loans or Letters of Credit are sought to be issued, pending consent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ec8822f0ae2be723af299c5930b2ed8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
