</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED UNAUDITED STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial reports not subjected to an audit, presenting a summary of the Borrower's operations and cash flows."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7db23745e08dce95f931014f491b519</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets involved in leases which can be subject to obligations under Capitalized Lease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets or resources that the Borrower or its subsidiaries may acquire or dispose of under consideration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets that may be subjected to legal claims or secured interests among lending arrangements, particularly in relation to the Borrower's obligations under agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to any assets owned by the Borrower that may be subject to inspection by the Administrative Agent during a Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to any assets that may be subject to non-ordinary course dispositions affecting overall loan agreements and financial conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to assets owned by the Borrower that may serve as collateral in financial agreements or loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the assets that could be involved in obligations related to the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all property owned, leased or operated by a Person, which may act as collateral for obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tangible or intangible assets that might be acquired or disposed of in the context of financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The property that is kept and maintained by the Borrower and its Major Subsidiaries which is material to the conduct of their business."&lt;SEP&gt;"create or suffer to exist any Lien in or on any of its Property."&lt;SEP&gt;"the property encumbered by the Lien is substantially similar in nature to the property encumbered by the otherwise permitted Lien that is being replaced."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d9b019f5d32da5b8873398bb878e3891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fe595a5786fed63447b5f397a25d7fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f0b98aec52fb64b5625c54126b83ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbc04f4bb02a514f3cd5a84a46dd521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85242d66571c09fe35aa36fa705e26f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-055d1e82013d8397017bf069a08e734a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfc99b3c1c21fe10f6e947ba5f57d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55bbee7de91bcf64aafb649099bde95</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NEW YORK TIME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New York time is the specified time zone in which the timing for requests and notifications regarding loans and letters of credit is calculated."</data>
