<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.12&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section in the agreement outlining the financial covenant that the Borrower must demonstrate compliance with."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.12 relates to other terms that may affect the Borrower's obligations in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 6.12 sets forth Financial Covenant requirements applicable to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8682b6b632c76068654dbc45fa760d28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55bbee7de91bcf64aafb649099bde95</data>
