  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A contractual arrangement concerning the use of property, which can have implications for liens and ownership."&lt;SEP&gt;"A contractual arrangement where one party rents property from another; specifically referred to in context with Capitalized Leases and Capitalized Lease Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan or borrowing arrangement where funds are made available to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advance refers to the provision of funds to the Borrower under the credit agreement, subject to conditions and consents defined by the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances are amounts the Lenders are committed to provide to the Borrower, handled by the Administrative Agent based on presumptions unless notified otherwise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds provided by Lenders to the Borrower before they are officially requested or due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of providing funds to the Borrower based on the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money that can be borrowed in the context of a loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The principal amount thereof, for each day from and including the date such Advance is made..."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Advance' refers to the aggregate amount and currency provided as a loan to the Borrower, indicating the financial transaction involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-13f1cbe5d37f2115e7fdee4a6fef2330&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec8822f0ae2be723af299c5930b2ed8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443cceb6eea0f4b1688789c95181be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-660ba35b7b2352a6dcf5d1814a86b611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30d6585214e77d70da4d2b41838c85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-436dbc8e8c3aea78e296e758404cb6e7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEVEL V&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pricing Level V as part of the Pricing Schedule in the Revolving Credit Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-928c9ed4796f36d4046ab5434f4288c0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section of the agreement detailing the requirement for the Borrower to furnish various financial statements and reports."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH COLLATERALIZE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Collateralize refers to the requirement for the Borrower to provide cash as collateral against Letters of Credit obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the pledge and deposit with the Administrative Agent for securing L/C Obligations or lender obligations, reflecting a structured financial commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of pledging and depositing cash with the Administrative Agent to support obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The action of securing cash collateral to cover potential obligations due to the Defaulting Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e07d22735da3f44da96c1e4f1bea670b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c120a778327f296345bae50f8d1508f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consent is required from Lenders for any waivers, amendments, or modifications in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consent pertains to the agreement of the Lender or Issuing Lender to proceed with the issuance of Eurocurrency Loans or Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various sections discuss the requirement for the consent of Lenders regarding amendments, waivers, and assignments..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-626e172089dfc80733dbdc3d5a655994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c42000811c18c4fe1fb14e6839c213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec8822f0ae2be723af299c5930b2ed8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL I&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The first tier of pricing applicable to borrowings under the credit agreement, used to determine the commitment fee based on public debt rating."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d48279d43f206b73878812648979f0eb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
