</node>
<node id="&quot;APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Approval is the decision made by the Administrative Agent and relevant Lenders to allow or deny various financial requests regarding loans and letters of credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ec8822f0ae2be723af299c5930b2ed8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
