</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.01(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A subsection in the agreement defining how the Borrower must demonstrate compliance with the appropriate accounting principles."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING LEVEL IV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The fourth tier of pricing applicable for public debt ratings, impacting the fees associated with borrowed funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d48279d43f206b73878812648979f0eb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FOREIGN EXCHANGE BUSINESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SERVICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business operations conducted by banks that are relevant to Eurocurrency Loans, as established in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;L/C CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional L/C Currency is the currency approved for Letters of Credit by Issuing Lenders, relevant for the Borrower's repayment obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f1be3cca81841828b69a682f741856e</data>
