<node id="&quot;BORROWER MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower Materials include all information related to the Borrower that may affect or disclose aspects of its financial status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower Materials refer to the documents or information provided by the Borrower related to the agreement, which are subject to review by the Agent Parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents or materials transmitted by the Borrower through the Internet as part of their obligations under the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Materials and information provided by or on behalf of the Borrower, which are made available to Lenders through electronic posting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Materials pertaining to the Borrower that may not be publicly disclosed, relevant for compliance with securities laws."</data>
