<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's obligation to provide financing as per the contractual terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments outline the financial obligations of the Lenders under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the lenders' obligations to provide financing as agreed in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments represent the obligations of the Lender to provide financing under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indicates the Lender's obligation to provide financing through loans and credits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations or sums that the Lender may be required to provide to the Borrower under various circumstances as stated within the credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments to lend hereunder shall expire automatically on the Facility Termination Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of Lenders to provide financing, which may be extended per the Borrower’s request."&lt;SEP&gt;"as long as such Lender shall be required to comply with any reserve ratio requirement or analogous requirement..."&lt;SEP&gt;"it shall have assigned all of its Commitments and Loans pursuant to Section 12.01(b) hereof at or prior to the time of such resignation."&lt;SEP&gt;"the remaining maturity of the Commitments should not exceed five years post-extension date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3ca04737f45a17e3fb227522494264c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c14c7925e4a607de0382cb8d2225da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-349e138a26328314f6d91c26c4b4d6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52bf93d3e20b62a0cd832df66353f563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6eb63f465378ef1651901525bcc3ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca6e59cb00ab074fd4164fff2fb0f72e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLATFORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Platform is a digital environment used for managing Borrower Materials and providing access to Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Platform is a system used to manage information flows and compliance for the Lenders and Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Platform refers to a system designated for communication and processing related to the credit agreement, described as provided 'AS IS' and 'AS AVAILABLE'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The electronic systems, such as DebtDomain or SyndTrak, where Borrower Materials are posted and accessed by Lenders and the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87fd223bdbce8cbc5531c412e0930ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a248a4d561291c597b0a80f7d7b6b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d984b41314faeae1eec3c3d4885dafca</data>
