<node id="&quot;CHANGE IN LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A clause in the agreement defining changes to applicable laws that could affect obligations and compliance under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A modification in laws impacting costs incurred by Lenders or Issuing Lenders, potentially triggering compensation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An alteration in law that impacts the costs associated with loans or agreements in place."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to any legal modifications affecting capital or liquidity requirements that could impact financial returns for the Lender or Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to any legal modifications imposing new obligations affecting the agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to any legislative act influencing lenders' obligations or regulations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52bf93d3e20b62a0cd832df66353f563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6998c9730d54cf4d09ee971139b5300</data>
