</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT SUPPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional forms of financial backing that may be required under the terms of the agreement in response to L/C Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIVE (5) BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specified period that must be met prior to the Facility Termination Date for the issuance or renewal of the Letter of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timeline of Five (5) Business Days indicates the period after notice of the Benchmark Replacement is provided to the Lenders before it takes effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3501bf74ffa65326e0d3555b82f8a65d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94c0222f445089aa6e963934b40deca9</data>
