  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;0.150% COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commitment fee charged under Pricing Level II for borrowers with a strong public debt rating."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d48279d43f206b73878812648979f0eb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 6.02 stipulates the use of proceeds from the Advances, detailing their allowed applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A body or agency that has the authority to enforce rules and regulations related to financial operations and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for imposing taxes and regulations that can impact the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for overseeing legal and financial obligations, including tax assessments and compliance related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that may be involved in the regulatory oversight of the loan transactions and potentially requiring payments from the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that may impose restrictions or requirements on the Issuing Lender regarding the issuance of Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that may influence the lender's obligations through ownership or equity interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Governmental Authority has asserted that it is unlawful for the Administrative Agent or any Lender to make Eurocurrency Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any authority that imposes taxes, levies, duties, or assessments as per law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that have the power to implement laws and regulations affecting the terms and execution of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Governmental Authority is responsible for overseeing compliance and regulations that may affect the Borrower or the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for overseeing compliance with tax laws and receives payments for withheld or deducted taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for overseeing the enforcement of tax regulations that may impact lender and borrower obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The government or any agency exercising regulatory powers or functions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ed9d7d04f3944a560b6db90e5050458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf894b623f9cbade8155fbff04b0edc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f007ed84b09aaafd346209ff90f4b1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81dca06289b2b356d8d67f8d32f94928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3679e0426d9ba539d7a46289e2bab63a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13482f9d41736bece8f6cc18418a9fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256b1931f6b1c4c3856140105237e337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94c0222f445089aa6e963934b40deca9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e1f22084ac500ab1a051f7b381aa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
