  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision in the agreement that outlines specific procedures and exceptions related to defaulting lenders in the context of Letters of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision within the credit agreement detailing cash collateralization procedures and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific section in the agreement that deals with cash collateral requirements for issuing lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.20 outlines specific obligations regarding the treatment of Defaulting Lenders and collateral management under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.20 outlines the terms and conditions under which Cash Collateral is to be provided and managed in relation to defaults by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific clause detailing provisions regarding cash collateral related to letters of credit."</data>
