  <data key="d1">"Major Subsidiaries of the Borrower that may be involved in financial obligations or proceedings related to the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower will cause each of the Major Subsidiaries to keep and maintain all property material to the conduct of its business."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Major Subsidiaries refer to significant subsidiaries of the Borrower that must also comply with laws and regulations as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The subsidiaries that the Borrower manages, responsible for admitting inability to pay debts and other financial obligations."</data>
