</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Commitment refers to a lender's obligation to provide financing as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender may... sell participations in all or a portion of such Lender’s rights and/or obligations under this Agreement (including all or a portion of its Commitment and/or the Loans)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment refers to the lender's obligation to provide financing as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment refers to the obligation of the Lenders to provide financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Increase the amount of the Commitment of any Lender hereunder (other than as expressly permitted by the terms of Section 2.23, Section 2.22...)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligation of Declining Lender that shall terminate on the Existing Stated Maturity Date applicable to such Declining Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount that the Lender is obligated to provide under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of a lender to provide financing as per the terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of each lender to make Revolving Loans according to the terms specified within the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total commitment amount provided by various lenders in the commitment schedule amounts to $800,000,000.00."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, for each Lender, the obligation of such Lender to (i) make Revolving Loans to the Borrower pursuant to Section 2.01(a) and (ii) purchase participations in L/C Obligations pursuant to Section 2.03."&lt;SEP&gt;"so long as any Lender shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation hereunder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-07fc883538bb5884b759a6d95b627c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf07809d1746fad0fc15e800a6e13c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3e5cabd1adf8bfb109a8c35cc714a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f11027b6de40e5187e572c3471f052&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128157f36e29f84a8759014f2c0bac7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-626e172089dfc80733dbdc3d5a655994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d78df53bf404a8c04f30aed8e096f054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060af3546316eae8ec7c622327912622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7ba5dd3dff3a1a68f89de13b8aa21f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f8540eaf8f40e45748d1788b0ef6de</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
