<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to a collective measure of the Property belonging to the Borrower and its Subsidiaries, which is vital for financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total assets of the Borrower at a specific time which may serve as a base for evaluating the maximum amount of indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, at any date of determination, the total amount, as shown on or reflected in the most recent consolidated balance sheet of the Borrower and its subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"the sum (without duplication) of the aggregate outstanding principal amount of Specified Indebtedness for Borrowed Money... does not exceed 10% of Consolidated Assets at such time"&lt;SEP&gt;"the total assets of the Borrower and its subsidiaries, including intercompany eliminations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d48c01f13ec86692718a0f2e1aa00e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbc04f4bb02a514f3cd5a84a46dd521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128157f36e29f84a8759014f2c0bac7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0acdd477847e0ceb3f6060dfa6826b3</data>
