<node id="&quot;GROSS NEGLIGENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A standard that must be met for the Issuing Lender to avoid liability in case of errors or omissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gross Negligence is a legal standard referenced in the Agreement that limits liability of Protected Parties for damages resulting from severe misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gross negligence refers to the threshold of conduct that the Administrative Agent must avoid to not be held accountable for the actions of sub-agents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the threshold of negligence that could preclude the Administrative Agent from liability in cases of indirect damages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af268fffead491c2994a023017c7b638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1a72299a7c8c944b15ac55292688d5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23731f788c5c083ebf38a42584c7dea</data>
