<node id="&quot;SPINOFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Spinoff represents a corporate action where a company creates a new independent company by selling or distributing new shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Spinoff refers to a particular commitment that affects the financial standing of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Spinoff refers to a specific corporate event affecting the Borrower that necessitates certain certifications in the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The distribution of shares of common stock of the Borrower to shareholders of XPO Logistics, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfc99b3c1c21fe10f6e947ba5f57d70</data>
