<node id="&quot;FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional charges associated with borrowing or advance provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fees are payments made that may relate to extraordinary, unusual, or non-recurring expenses in connection to the Borrower's financial activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fees refer to the amounts due and payable by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent and the Lenders for services and costs associated with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monetary charges imposed on the Borrower for services rendered by the Lender or Agents as outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monetary charges incurred as part of the financial agreement, particularly involving Defaulting and Non-Defaulting Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various charges associated with maintaining the loan agreement where the Borrower has obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrower shall have paid all fees, costs and expenses due and payable to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2784e996404efd1f12a712b7977889c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4775969ba9c4358815c44ba19ab6cf61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4a3c6e75cb695a5901b1f0b84cdb53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8c546287864ea4d788574dbe3580df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfc99b3c1c21fe10f6e947ba5f57d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6</data>
