<node id="&quot;CONTROLLED GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All members of a controlled group of corporations and other entities under common control with the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity related to the Borrower that affects the contributions to the Multiemployer Plans and is tied to withdrawal liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any member of its Controlled Group, is not covered by ERISA pursuant to Section 4(b)(4) of ERISA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a group of entities that are related and may share liabilities under certain agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The broader group of entities linked to the Borrower that may also share obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"a group constituted by the Borrower and its subsidiaries for operational or financial purposes."</data>
