  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Communication delivered by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent regarding prepayment or repayment details."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formal communication provided by the Administrative Agent regarding the implementation of any Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formal communication sent by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent regarding the borrowing terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice is the communication issued by the Administrative Agent to inform other parties of their resignation and any subsequent actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notifications that the Borrower must provide to the Administrative Agent regarding commitment reductions or other relevant actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The requirement for notice regarding the Guaranteed Obligations is a covenant that the Guarantor waives upon becoming a party."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6cc6030818dd3429d755aaf140adc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509c304656080c8e86ce3cd455d89065&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-904c0cc387dffe2b87a7d3f92f2a414f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbd5056a9b1d822dcccb189f309820c</data>
