<node id="&quot;LIBOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A commonly used benchmark for interest rates that may be transitioned away from."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate that is being replaced, relevant to the context of loan agreements and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate used in the agreement for Eurocurrency Advances, determining interest payments based on market conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR has either permanently or indefinitely ceased to be provided by IBA or have been announced by the FCA pursuant to public statement or publication of information to be no longer representative."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR is published as the London interbank offered rate for deposits in dollars on the applicable Reuters screen page."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR is the benchmark interest rate for amounts denominated in Dollars, establishing a standard for borrowing costs in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR serves as a prior benchmark rate for various available tenors."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR serves as a reference interest rate which may be replaced according to regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR, the London Interbank Offered Rate, is a key benchmark for interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"London Interbank Offered Rate, one of the benchmarks that may be referenced in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The London Interbank Offered Rate, one of the benchmarks that may be replaced during fallback provisions in the syndicated credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The London Interbank Offered Rate, which is used as a reference interest rate in financial contracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"a reference interest rate defined in the context of Eurocurrency Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"for any interest calculation with respect to an Alternate Base Rate Loan..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eb2d822d34cd4895bb4832559ec6c10d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98873f0978b82c2fd29714e88f71122d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf894b623f9cbade8155fbff04b0edc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5807ed590c9a7272d374bb401a2dc73b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69c40f76d1bb8ba3d996a93ada3d2c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-660ba35b7b2352a6dcf5d1814a86b611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21b7d377704d41cd539f04a2c3d2a312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5688b6fd8f243ed8c9414896fb34a20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3501bf74ffa65326e0d3555b82f8a65d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50d92f3ae85f5d9dc7cd636aa2549b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da412b37f50503895e084a2932cc427&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd87b489c39e698fbb3a8adc142a822</data>
