<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan refers to the amounts borrowed by the Borrower as per the terms outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal contract outlining terms between parties regarding the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement provided by the Lender, allowing the borrower to draw funds as needed under the terms specified in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sum of money that is borrowed or lent, often subject to specific terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any continuation, conversion, payment or prepayment of any Loan other than an Alternate Base Rate Loan on a day other than the last day of the Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any representation or warranty made by the Borrower to the Lenders or the Administrative Agent under this Agreement..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Loan made under the Noteless Agreement has specific types and interest periods noted in the agent's records."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the loan being discussed under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan refers to the sum of money borrowed by the Borrower, subject to the conditions outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The breach by the Borrower of... shall constitute a Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial amount provided by the lender to the Borrower with terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"an extension of credit by a lender to the borrower in the form of a revolving loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Loan or other Obligation hereunder (other than any contingent indemnification obligations for which no claim has been made)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ed9d7d04f3944a560b6db90e5050458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4775969ba9c4358815c44ba19ab6cf61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4624e829973bed7d3dbe1f2bc639fd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edf07809d1746fad0fc15e800a6e13c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23cc38126f5fc772e7c16a84edaa089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2f0619713166fc84a2c2b0e0230d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7c6cce4fccfd6907fab04622874d2ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91e39b4cb51361795b6a0cd59c0305c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041fd1af71b876447afbbb6e3c656bab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
