<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ADVERSE EFFECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Material Adverse Effect refers to a significant negative impact that would affect the Borrower's operations or compliance obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A clause that defines significant negative changes affecting the borrower’s financial status."&lt;SEP&gt;"A condition that may negatively impact the Borrower's ability to fulfill obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined condition that could adversely affect the Borrower's ability to fulfill its obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant negative impact on the financial condition of the Borrower as defined in the agreement, particularly due to withdrawal liability contributions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term referring to the negative consequences that can arise from failures in maintaining the property or insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exception clause stating that the failure to pay Taxes would not be expected to result in a Material Adverse Effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect refers to any event that significantly affects the Borrower's ability to meet its obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material Adverse Effect refers to circumstances that significantly impact the borrower's obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Material adverse effect refers to significant negative changes in the Borrower's financial condition or operations that could impact obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a clause defining a significant adverse impact on the Borrower's financial condition or business, affecting the rights of Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the negative effects that could impact the borrower's ability to meet obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term Material Adverse Effect describes conditions affecting the Borrower's compliance with obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"failure to have such authority would not reasonably be expected to have a Material Adverse Effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9fe595a5786fed63447b5f397a25d7fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a5395386d972c6903e35205b0eb8cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cfcb4f8a699443d740caa150eba6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4624e829973bed7d3dbe1f2bc639fd07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f0b98aec52fb64b5625c54126b83ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c6c404a605dbcd15dc33cc74d996977&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b75c230455e9616a385ea8bda68b04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-055d1e82013d8397017bf069a08e734a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd87b489c39e698fbb3a8adc142a822</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
