  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets pledged by GXO LOGISTICS, INC. which serve to secure the loan, providing lenders with a legal right over these assets in case of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets pledged by the Borrower to secure the Loans provided by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets pledged by the Borrower to secure their obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal claims associated with the Borrower that can be used to secure the Guaranteed Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The assets pledged to secure any loans provided under the terms of the Agreement."</data>
