<node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions and restrictions imposed on the Borrower to ensure compliance with the Agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Detailed sections outlining financial reporting, use of proceeds, notice of default, and compliance with laws as conditions required from the borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial and operational restrictions imposed on GXO LOGISTICS, INC. that must be adhered to as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"From the Closing Date, so long as any Lender shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation hereunder."&lt;SEP&gt;"The breach by the Borrower of (a) any of the terms or provisions of Section 6.03, 6.09, 6.10, 6.11 or 6.12 or (b) any of the other terms or provisions of this Agreement which is not remedied within thirty (30) days after the Borrower knows of the occurrence thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The various commitments and conditions that the Borrower must adhere to as outlined in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c6c404a605dbcd15dc33cc74d996977&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23cc38126f5fc772e7c16a84edaa089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-055d1e82013d8397017bf069a08e734a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18692c17359acf3a4cc5b222ca8d5302</data>
