<node id="&quot;REVOLVING LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A flexible borrowing arrangement allowing the Borrower to draw funds as needed, up to a predetermined limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement involving loans that can be borrowed and repaid multiple times."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured loan arrangement available to the borrower, allowing for repeated borrowing and repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the Borrower to borrow, repay, and borrow again, subject to the limits agreed upon in the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that allows the borrower to withdraw, repay, and withdraw again, up to a specified limit, reflecting the borrower's outstanding credit exposure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Revolving Borrowing made under this Section 2.01(a) shall consist of Revolving Loans made from the several Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Multiple loans that are provided under the Revolving Loan agreement, facilitating ongoing borrowing as needed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the structured loan arrangement that allows borrowers to withdraw, repay, and borrow again."&lt;SEP&gt;"Revolving Loans are loans under the credit facility that can be borrowed, repaid, and borrowed again, providing financial flexibility to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Revolving Loans are structured credit facilities that Lenders make available to the Borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower shall, upon demand from such Lender, prepay or convert all Eurocurrency Loans of such Lender to Alternate Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"the obligation of such Lender to make Revolving Loans to the Borrower pursuant to Section 2.01(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0a8f315e0d4cc8cd2accfbbe5da06a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c87b9e7043c61cd132d4af9cb79a608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a73a441bb280da7c7eac26f41db97d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77861f28d368fffce8cb139bd90225db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2f0619713166fc84a2c2b0e0230d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128157f36e29f84a8759014f2c0bac7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3e7677f7f7b78ac8baeaf00df9e5e3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd87b489c39e698fbb3a8adc142a822</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
