<node id="&quot;FINAL AND NONAPPEALABLE JUDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal decision that is definitive and cannot be contested, potentially affecting obligations under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Final and Nonappealable Judgment refers to the conclusive legal determination that influences indemnity stipulations outlined in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcfdf8a71bd320a62004e0e384e11c46</data>
