  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Obligations that are not fully funded which may affect the borrower's financial health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations that are not fully funded, which may impact the financial health of a borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The aggregate unfunded liabilities that could result in a material adverse effect regarding the Borrower's ability to meet its financial commitments."</data>
