  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Euro is the lawful currency that may be adopted by member states of the European Union, affecting the repayment obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The single currency of the European Union, as constituted by the Treaty on European Union."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c84f13ebb93a2379c4e024700e6b9a83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f1be3cca81841828b69a682f741856e</data>
