</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH COLLATERAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assets pledged as collateral for the loan facility to secure repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets pledged to secure loans, specifically used for the benefit of the Lenders in case of excess credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets set aside to cover potential future obligations of a Defaulting Lender, ensuring lenders' exposure is mitigated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assets used to secure a loan, particularly in relation to Defaulting Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral includes assets provided by the Borrower to secure their obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral is an amount held to secure the interests of Lenders against potential defaults by a Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral refers to cash assets pledged by the Borrower to secure obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash Collateral refers to cash or deposit account balances that are assets pledged to secure a loan, specifically in relation to Letters of Credit issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash deposited to secure the obligations related to the Letters of Credit issued by the Issuing Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds provided to secure the obligations of the Defaulting Lender and protect participations in letters of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds that the Borrower must provide to secure the L/C Obligations if certain conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to cash or deposit account balances pledged as collateral for L/C Obligations and obligations of the lenders, as described in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the application of Cash Collateral as provided in Section 2.20."&lt;SEP&gt;"the report shall include any reimbursement, Cash Collateral, or termination in respect of Letters of Credit issued by such Issuing Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3ca04737f45a17e3fb227522494264c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc38152b0f228851eb2001881889cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03b2d3addc3724118fcaa9cbe2d864f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dde35fec0c8bee31e9959cd10aeb752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e198d77431c861292a99379d78c97060&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef03c2a3bc83b467c592d30c98456018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07d22735da3f44da96c1e4f1bea670b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bfb84ae77fdaa5e8c3a97e04c2e26f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b237e569bb47a68fc1dfc5a53add55c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dd87b489c39e698fbb3a8adc142a822</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-0a132332ec994ff64af411572927a941</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-gxo</data>
</node>
