<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "OBLIGATIONS" encompasses the array of financial duties, responsibilities, and commitments owed by the Borrower to various parties, primarily the Agents and Lenders, under the Loan Documents and credit agreements. These obligations include all loans, letters of credit (L/C) obligations, debts, liabilities, covenants, and any other duties that are legally binding on the Borrower. They specifically detail all amounts due and unpaid by the Borrower to the Lenders, encapsulating both principal and interest payments.

The obligations are characterized by the legal commitments the Borrower is required to fulfill, which may include repayment of borrowed money and compliance with all contractual terms. The Borrower has a duty to perform its obligations punctually and fully as laid out in the agreement. This includes the requirement to repay all debts and fulfill every covenant of the credit agreement.

Moreover, the obligations also extend to cover any relevant financial responsibilities that may arise from lease agreements, particularly concerning Capitalized Leases and lease-related liabilities. Additionally, they pertain to responsibilities of the Borrower and its subsidiaries regarding the repayment or management of any indebtedness.

In summary, the Obligations represent the full extent of the Borrower’s financial responsibilities, highlighting the importance of timely repayment of all debts as documented and maintained by the Administrative Agent, ensuring that both legal and financial duties are satisfactorily discharged under the Loan Documents.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-044c8c17addf705b3a705cce6b061dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3e5cabd1adf8bfb109a8c35cc714a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b5f19a0770314c9062282c6df3f08fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4775969ba9c4358815c44ba19ab6cf61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50dc3791859bd42e6b79be8ac39d58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443cceb6eea0f4b1688789c95181be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6eb63f465378ef1651901525bcc3ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-367efea91f14c308908cbf46f7b778de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01fa9414c8f55fa15b04b2759525b64c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-055d1e82013d8397017bf069a08e734a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bddd2264c99015efb820b7c4e86acbf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83c42000811c18c4fe1fb14e6839c213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51e0b942fc38bb2172bde4cb6d8e8480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2784e996404efd1f12a712b7977889c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03b2d3addc3724118fcaa9cbe2d864f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c120a778327f296345bae50f8d1508f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8faad6dc190779488071e1a1e21383a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c088153227b34dfaa95e623edf217ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fe595a5786fed63447b5f397a25d7fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a52ff11a1589fe75d0346ef535d42ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aa9c35788b69a204e6324308aa3b79f</data>
