<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">A Subsidiary is an entity that is either wholly or partially owned or controlled by the Borrower. It is significant in the context of loan agreements, as it may impact the terms and conditions of those agreements. Specifically, a Subsidiary is defined as an entity over which the Borrower has control, which may include financial obligations and covenants outlined in the credit agreement. Such entities may be required to reimburse the Issuing Lender in connection with Letters of Credit and can also serve as Guarantors under certain conditions.

The relationship between the Borrower and its Subsidiaries is critical, as it entails the Borrower's responsibility to ensure that all tax returns and reports required for these Subsidiaries have been filed in a timely manner. Furthermore, a Subsidiary may incur liens on its property to secure or provide for the payment of any indebtedness for borrowed money. The concept of "Change of Control" is often relevant, suggesting that more than 50% of a Subsidiary’s outstanding securities must be owned or controlled by the Borrower or its other Subsidiaries.

The term also encompasses any subordinate companies that the Borrower owns or controls, which may carry potential financial obligations, and indicates a broader definition where any company controlled by the Borrower may also engage in agreements, such as participation as a Guarantor. Thus, the essence of a Subsidiary highlights the interconnectedness of financial responsibilities and control under the financial agreements involving the Borrower.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-57790ed9c8601659e5a900ae22c9e87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca92fb46e43aac35741ad94be06baf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e631a64c88c6919f8b9a9bcae9c00286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d48c01f13ec86692718a0f2e1aa00e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eb96d7191b0699d9084c61a58e1f937&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a52ff11a1589fe75d0346ef535d42ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060af3546316eae8ec7c622327912622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55bbee7de91bcf64aafb649099bde95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe12461084bb91bf3fa92e79fc2890e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eafbdd125e44e090d5ed4a2ad20dd7</data>
