<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Borrower" refers to an entity that is receiving financing under a loan agreement and has various obligations relating to the repayment of that financing. This entity, which may also include its subsidiaries, is responsible for making timely payments of principal, interest, fees, and other obligations as outlined in the agreement. The Borrower must maintain certain documentation, comply with applicable laws and regulations, including Anti-Corruption Laws, and ensure all obligations are fulfilled as specified in the loan documentation.

As the party receiving the loan, the Borrower is entitled to request funds, including loans and letters of credit, subject to prior approval by the Administrative Agent and lenders. The Borrower is also obligated to provide necessary financial information, maintain proper records, and adhere to financial covenants, which can involve delivering compliance certificates and financial statements to the Administrative Agent.

In the context of changes to loan terms or the issuance of letters of credit, the Borrower retains certain responsibilities, such as notifying the Administrative Agent of payment issues or any significant defaults. The Borrower's obligations even extend to reimbursing lenders for amounts drawn under letters of credit and managing its debts and liabilities. Moreover, the Borrower must satisfy conditions for borrowing, including those pertaining to currency and interest rates associated with loans.

The Borrower is not granted third-party beneficiary rights outside of specifically mentioned contexts within the agreement, and it cannot assign its rights or obligations without following stipulated procedures. Additionally, the Borrower is identified as the party responsible for payments made under the terms of the agreement, which must be executed in compliance with all referenced obligations.

Overall, the Borrower plays a critical role in the loan agreement, interacting with the Administrative Agent and lenders, managing financial risks, and ensuring adherence to all outlined terms and</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d48c01f13ec86692718a0f2e1aa00e7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a575e820a47b3c2dbd1089d67ed6dfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c568b4b23ac5cd142b7bb3de2e9123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3e5cabd1adf8bfb109a8c35cc714a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45eacffe710b8a1539c2b0e28ec9c0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97ea2c276659bea1c507ce8061fac280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128157f36e29f84a8759014f2c0bac7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a248a4d561291c597b0a80f7d7b6b35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88c08aa03f546119db2aa5503fb5d3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bfc99b3c1c21fe10f6e947ba5f57d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6e6633392fc0a2358006ce0dd843d1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d82c1146b4efba6097c4e3cc70a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-505094570d348d1eb98341b07550afb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1a72299a7c8c944b15ac55292688d5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8779071286711185e7ec64cc9f3e085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6eb63f465378ef1651901525bcc3ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f81c89a4f0646075ebbb8d120c81f1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-455f5d24af85e0e01ce99360a0fe0f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30985c7e8f8dee391f2bd509a43ea515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4792b5b0b77bf53c196055d4d402e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9cd184601902e993589a5485493e18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c14c7925e4a607de0382cb8d2225da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6325bfa6d1cd9b9d3bc87034e1d3d3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0d8174003f4772facdd639b135093a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fe64f66c3bae5bd7a455b76b08b5bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-051db1920040c63c8845f15fd1ebdf8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9164310bb510717cd7cd3ab94e1d97c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef03c2a3bc83b467c592d30c98456018&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23cc38126f5fc772e7c16a84edaa089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-904c0cc387dffe2b87a7d3f92f2a414f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc596f8efd3d960e41a0c7ead13fb1fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee99ae045b011273b805e2d9acdc4dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6486173d4e89e0b5a1e51ec7b8969261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e537cc0fdd4eb245e770ae2d38a157f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c340d96c262ce6b46bd104eff6e1e898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6cc6030818dd342