<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Closing Date" is a crucial and specified date in the context of loan transactions and agreements. It marks the official moment when the loan agreement is executed and finalized, thus activating its terms and conditions. This date indicates the point at which various aspects of the agreement take effect, including the initiation of interest calculations and the issuing of Letters of Credit subject to the provided terms.

The Closing Date is also significant as it delineates when the financial transaction is completed, particularly regarding the Borrower's solvency and the establishment of agreements related to their financing structure, including any pertinent liabilities and liens. It is essential that all specified conditions outlined in the agreement are either satisfied or waived by this date to ensure smooth execution.

Furthermore, the Closing Date represents the moment when certifications are made—confirming that no defaults or unmatured defaults exist as of that date, and it plays a critical role in defining compliance with the terms of the agreement among the involved parties. The Administrative Agent confirms this date, highlighting its importance in the overall structure of the financing arrangement. 

In summary, the Closing Date is a pivotal event that signifies not only the finalization of the loan transaction but also triggers the effectiveness of the agreement and related financial responsibilities.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-99e694a36ce9e20cd42f9c5918c7a197&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1183a800fd6a9854db176c7afeee466f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e914eec878b034344a2461c17601e972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45eacffe710b8a1539c2b0e28ec9c0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bc6fb03d3fef88e01a6cce943dfcd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a44537e6b80de7561b3cfa10fb6a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41bfd1f29617baadfd89500cddebd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bfa88e74387e9ded8d6d400ce29b863&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5cae935d5ac1c45cef47e54948aebca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24b299af046284d0d960e7277a78caa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8c546287864ea4d788574dbe3580df8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-039451d90b356c9b728719b3f47939fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7db23745e08dce95f931014f491b519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0b1eebe2d58609217c8bdecde0f604c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e55ec0667ebf49101d269a842009d25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cfcb4f8a699443d740caa150eba6f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-349e138a26328314f6d91c26c4b4d6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d40e5eaf64a1cf442eb0d95460cb74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23cc38126f5fc772e7c16a84edaa089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cbe80e57800f5428ab88cd36b4f48ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060af3546316eae8ec7c622327912622</data>
